<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ROM" style="id">- WolioNT</book>
  <para style="ide">65001 - Unicode (UTF-8)</para>
  <para style="rem">First draft Jun 2018. First revision Juni 2021. Team check Mar 2024. Cek Konsultan Maret 2026, Disetujui April 2026, Published Mei 2026.</para>
  <para style="h">ROMA</para>
  <para style="toc3">Rom.</para>
  <para style="toc2">Roma</para>
  <para style="toc1">SURANA PAUL TO JAMAʼA I ROMA</para>
  <para style="mt2">SURANA PAUL</para>
  <para style="mt2">TO JAMAʼA I</para>
  <para style="mt1">ROMA</para>
  <para style="is">POGAU BHAA-BHAANA</para>
  <para style="im">
    <char style="bk">Surana Paul To Jamaʼa i Roma</char> atoburi to apasiapuaka manga incia wakutuuna bhealeongia Paul. Sura incia sii atoburi kera-kera i tao 55 M (Masehi), aipomo minaaka i Kota Korintus wakutuuna Paul indapo alingka i Kota Yerusalem to abhawaaka kahambana to atulungiaka opea ifaraluuna manga mia moparacaeana iwe sumai. Mboomo haejatina, Paul bheakarajaa sabantaramea to manga mia moparacaeana tee Isa Al Masi iwe sumai, kasiimpo tee kahambana manga mia iwe sumai, incia gauna bhealingka i Tana Spanyol. Paul aburi sura incia sii to apajelasiaka giu imatauna pokaiana tee agamana manga mia moosena Al Masi tee bhari-bharia tutura momembalina ipewauna manga mia moosena Al Masi i nuncana dhadhina saesaeo.</para>
  <para style="ip">Sapadhana apakawaaka salamuna to manga miana jamaʼa i Kota Roma tee apaumbaaka pokaiana doʼana to manga incia, Paul apogauakamo antona fikirina surana sii: "Tee Lele Malape sumai, Aulataʼala asusuakea tuaapa o pokaiana maanusia tee Aulataʼala amembali apomalape; carana siitumo tee taparacaea tee Aulataʼala minaaka i auwalina sakawana i kapadhaana" (1:17).</para>
  <para style="ip">Sapadhana incia sumai i pasala 1-4 Paul apetulatulaakamo maʼanana antona fikirina surana sumai. Paul apogau ande bhari-bharia mia -- malape miana Yahudi atawa mia inda motolentuna miana Yahudi -- tabeana apekalapea o pokaiana tee Aulataʼala, roonamo bhari-bharia adhaangia i nuncana kuasana dosa. Pokaiana maanusia tee Aulataʼala bheapomalape, ande o maanusia aparacaea tee Isa Al Masi. Kasiimpo Paul apetulatulaaka dhadhi bhaau inamisina maanusia ande aposaangu tee Al Masi. Dhadhi bhaau sumai bheahanda ajulu roonamo kadhaangiana pokaia mobhaau tee Aulataʼala. Mia moparacaeana tee Isa bheadhadhi malape tee Aulataʼala, tee o Rohina Aulataʼala bheapabebasia minaaka i kuasana dosa tee mate. I nuncana pasala 5-8 Paul apajelasiaka maʼanana manga hukumuna Aulataʼala tee Rohina Aulataʼala i nuncana dhadhina manga mia moparacaea. Kasiimpo i pasala 9-11 Paul apajelasiakea ande o miana Yahudi tee mia inda motolentuna miana Yahudi apesua i nuncana haejatina Aulataʼala to uumatina maanusia. Paul apajelasiakea ande o miana Yahudi momendeuna Isa padhamo apesua i nuncana haejatina Aulataʼala to atulungiaka manga mia inda motolentuna miana Yahudi tee rahumatina alaloi Isa Al Masi. Paul ayaakini ande o miana Yahudi inda bheatorotorosu amendeu Isa. Sumaimo i pasala 12-15 Paul aburiakea mamudhaakana o mia amataua tuaapa o carana to tadhadhiaka mboomo laengana mia moosena Al Masi; mofaraluuna mpuu i nuncana sura incia sii satotuuna tuaapa o carana tadhadhi tee kaasi i nuncana pokaiata tee mia mosagaanana. Rampaakanamo sumai o Paul apili mofaraluuna mpuu, siitumo: tuaapa o carana talaiani Aulataʼala, opea iwaajibuakana mia moosena Al Masi to lipuna tee opea iwaajibuakata podho-podho ingkita o mia moosena Al Masi, tee o urusa mosagaanana pokaiana tee antona ngangaranda. I pasala 15-16 Paul atutubhi surana sii tee kasameana karona to manga sabhangkana tee sagala kapujia to Aulataʼala.</para>
  <para style="iot">Antona</para>
  <para style="io1">Paul Apakoleleaka Surana to Manga Mia Moparacaeana i Kota Roma <char style="ior"><ref loc="ROM 1:1-17">1:1-17</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kadhaangiana Maanusia i Aroana Aulataʼala <char style="ior"><ref loc="ROM 1:18-3:20">1:18--3:20</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Dhalana Kasalaamati minaaka i Aulataʼala <char style="ior"><ref loc="ROM 3:21-4:25">3:21--4:25</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Dhadhi Bhaau Rampaakanamo Tadhadhi Taposaangu tee Isa Al Masi <char style="ior"><ref loc="ROM 5:1-8:39">5:1--8:39</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Haejatina Aulataʼala to Uumatina Israel <char style="ior"><ref loc="ROM 9:1-11:36">9:1--11:36</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Carana Tadhadhi Tamembali Mia Moosena Al Masi<char style="ior"><ref loc="ROM 12:1-15:13">12:1--15:13</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Pogau Kapadhaa tee Salamuna Paul <char style="ior"><ref loc="ROM 15:14-16:27">15:14--16:27</ref> </char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ROM 1" />
  <para style="s1">Salamu</para>
  <para style="sr">
    <ref loc="ROM 1:1-7">1:1-7</ref>
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 1:1" />Minaaka i Paul, bhatuana Isa Al Masi, motokembana to momembalina rasulu tee mopadhana ipili to mopakoleleakana Lele Malapena Aulataʼala. <verse eid="ROM 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 1:2" />Lele Malape sumai padhamo ajanjiakea Aulataʼala minaaka i zamani i piamo itu alaloi manga nabiina tee padhamo atoburi i nuncana manga Kitabi Momangkilo. <verse eid="ROM 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 1:3" />Lele Malape sumai apogauaka Anana Aulataʼala,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:3 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Anana Aulataʼala: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Saro incia sii atopake to asarongiaka Al Masi, roonamo Incia dhaangia tee pokaiana mohususu tee Aulataʼala. Kamatea o kaburi, "Anana Aulataʼala" i talikuna boku incia sii. </char></note> siitumo o Ana ipalaahiri momembalina samia maanusia molaloina siwuluna Raja Daud,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:3 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">siwuluna Raja Daud: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Abhari o rajana Israel tee Yudea motosarongina 'siwuluna Raja Daud'. Sainamo i nuncana Pojanjia Bhaau, 'siwuluna Raja Daud' atomaʼanai uka amembali saro mosagaanana to 'Al Masi' atawa 'Rajana Kasalaamati Ijanjiakana'. </char></note> <verse eid="ROM 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 1:4" />tee i nuncana Rohi imangkiloaka atopatotapuaka amembali Anana Aulataʼala mokokuasana alaloi dhadhiana pendua minaaka i tanga-tangana mia mate. Incia satotuuna o Isa Al Masi Oputa Momalanga. <verse eid="ROM 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 1:5" />Alaloi Isa, ingkami tatarima rahumati to tamembaliaka rasulu tee tabhawa bhari-bharia suku inda motolentuna miana Yahudi i kataʼatina iimani mamudhaakana o sarona atomuliangi. <verse eid="ROM 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 1:6" />Ingkomiu uka upesua i nuncana mia inda motolentuna miana Yahudi momembalina pewauana Isa Al Masi. <verse eid="ROM 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 1:7" />E bhari-bharikomiu momboorena i Kota Roma imaasiakana Aulataʼala tee ikembana to amembali mia momangkilo: Rahumati tee dhadhi malape minaaka i Aulataʼala o Amata tee minaaka i Isa Al Masi Oputa Momalanga apoose tee ingkomiu.<verse eid="ROM 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Paul Aemani Sukuru tee Gauna Alingka i Roma</para>
  <para style="sr">
    <ref loc="ROM 1:8-15">1:8-15</ref>
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 1:8" />Bhaa-bhaana iaku kuemani sukuru i Aulataʼalaku alaloi Isa Al Masi to bhari-bharikomiu, roonamo abhari mia i saangua dunia arangomea ande ingkomiu uparacaea tee Isa Al Masi. <verse eid="ROM 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 1:9" />Aulataʼala amembali sakusiiku, ande iaku inda kuunto-unto kuudhanikomiu i nuncana doʼaku. Incia kulaiania tee kampuu-mpuuna incaku wakutuuna kupakoleleaka Lele Malapena Anana Aulataʼala. <verse eid="ROM 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 1:10" />Iaku uka kudoʼa tee kuemani mpuu i Aulataʼala mamudhaakana sii-sii adhawuaku kalalesa to kuleongikomiu. <verse eid="ROM 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 1:11" />Roonamo iaku gauku mpuu kupokawa tee ingkomiu mamudhaakana kubage-bageakakomiu rahumati minaaka i Rohina Aulataʼala sabutuna amatangka o iimanimiu. <verse eid="ROM 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 1:12" />Maʼanana, mamudhaakana ingkita tapokanakana tatopekatangka rampaakanamo iimanita samia-samia, siitumo iimanimiu tee iimaniku. <verse eid="ROM 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 1:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 19:21">Tul. 19:21</ref>.</char></note>E manga witinai, iaku gauku ingkomiu umataua, ande amenturumo kuhaejati to kuumbatikomiu, maka sakawana sii-sii indapo tee kalalesaku roonamo dhaangiapo tee tampalesuku. Iaku gauku opea ikarajaaku sii dhaangia tee hasilina to ingkomiu, apokana mboomo wakutuuna kudhaangia i tanga-tangana lipu mosagaanana inda motolentuna miana Yahudi. <verse eid="ROM 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 1:14" />Roonamo kuwaajibu to kulaiani bhari-bharia mia inda motolentuna miana Yahudi, malape miana Yunani mokeniakana adati atawa o mia dhaga inda mokeniakana adati, malape o mia momalapena budina atawa o mia mokabhongo-bhongo. <verse eid="ROM 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 1:15" />Rampaakanamo sumai iaku gauku mpuu kupakawaaka Lele Malape to ingkomiu momboorena i Kota Roma.<verse eid="ROM 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lele Malape sumai o Kuasana Aulataʼala to Mopasalaamatina Maanusia</para>
  <para style="sr">
    <ref loc="ROM 1:16-17">1:16-17</ref>
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 1:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:16 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MRK 8:38">Mrk. 8:38</ref>.</char>
    </note>Iaku inda kumaea rampaakanamo Lele Malape sumai, roonamo Lele Malape sumai o kuasana Aulataʼala to mopasalaamatina bhari-bharia mia moparacaeana tee Incia, bhaa-bhaana to miana Yahudi, kasiimpo to mia inda motolentuna miana Yahudi. <verse eid="ROM 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 1:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HAB 2:4">Hab. 2:4</ref>.</char></note>Tee Lele Malape sumai, Aulataʼala asusuakea tuaapa o kabanarana pokaiana maanusia tee Aulataʼala apomalape, carana siitumo tee taparacaea tee Aulataʼala minaaka i auwalina sakawana i kapadhaana.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:17 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">minaaka i auwalina sakawana i kapadhaana: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">I nuncana pogau Yunani, pogau incia sii atoburi, "Minaaka i iimani to iimani," tee kabilanga mboomo 1) ibarati momembalina mokomaʼana ande o iimani ahandamo ajulu, 2) Aulataʼala satotuuna o minaana iimanina samia maanusia, atawa 3) mosusuakana ande o Lele Malape atopakoleleaka minaaka i mia moparacaeana tee Aulataʼala to mia mosagaanana mamudhaakana manga incia aparacaeaia. </char></note> Giu incia sumai apokana mboomo mopadhana motoburina i nuncana Kitabi Momangkilo, "Mia mobanara bheadhadhi alaloi iimanina."<verse eid="ROM 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kahukumuna Aulataʼala to Mia Mokodosa tee Kadhakina Maanusia</para>
  <para style="sr">
    <ref loc="ROM 1:18-32">1:18-32</ref>
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 1:18" />Minaaka i sorogaa o Aulataʼala apatokamata pamuruna to bhari-bharia kadhaki ipewauna maanusia. Manga incia inda ahoromati Aulataʼala tee apopasala-sala podho-podho manga incia. Kadhakina manga incia amembali giu mojoli-jolina kabanarana Aulataʼala to imatauta. <verse eid="ROM 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 1:19" />Opea imatauna maanusia to Aulataʼala atinda mpuu i nuncana ngangarandana manga incia, sababuna o Aulataʼala mopakawaakana giu incia sumai to maanusia. <verse eid="ROM 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 1:20" />Roonamo pepuu minaaka o alamu atopadhaangia, bhari-bharia sifatuna Aulataʼala inda motokamatana, siitumo kuasana mobakaa tee o maanusia amataua ande Incia atotuu-totuu Aulataʼala, atindamo i fikirina maanusia alaloi bhari-bharia giu mopadhana ipadhaangiana Aulataʼala. Tee mboo sumai, manga incia indamo tee alasana to apabanara karona. <verse eid="ROM 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 1:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 4:17-18">Ef. 4:17-18</ref>.</char></note>Roonamo garaaka manga incia amataumea ande o Aulataʼala sumai adhaangia, maka manga incia inda amuliangia mboomo laengana Aulataʼala atawa inda asukuru tee Incia, sampe manga incia soo afikiriaka manga giu mosia-sia tee o ngangarandana manga incia amalalanda. <verse eid="ROM 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 1:22" />Manga incia aabhi karona mboomo mia momalapena budina, garaaka manga incia akabhongo-bhongo. <verse eid="ROM 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 1:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 4:16-18">Kap. 4:16-18</ref>.</char></note>Manga incia inda amuliangi Aulataʼala mobakaa, maka asomba manga patu moposiingina tee manga mahaluku momembalina momate, siitumo maanusia, manu-manu, binata mokoaena patambali tee binata mopondele.<verse eid="ROM 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 1:24" />Rampaakanamo sumai o Aulataʼala ataroaka manga incia akuasaia kapeeluana ngangarandana mobukeakana karombu, sabutuna manga incia apewau manga giu mopanaajisina badana karona samia-samia. <verse eid="ROM 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 1:25" />Manga incia apapobholosi kabanarana Aulataʼala tee kagau-gau, tee mencuana Mopadhaangiaia isombana, maka manga incia asomba tee alaiani manga giu mopadhana ipadhaangiana maanusia, garaaka o Aulataʼala sumai molaengana ipuji saʼumurua! Aamin. <verse eid="ROM 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 1:26" />Rampaakanamo sumai manga incia ataroakea Aulataʼala to akuasaiaka nawusuuna karona. Tee uka manga bhawine modhaangiana iwe sumai amendeumo akole tee umane mboomo laengana, maka manga incia alabhimo apili akole podho-podho bhawine. <verse eid="ROM 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 1:27" />Mencuana tangkanamo bhawine, maka o umane uka akole podho-podho umane. Manga incia indamo akole tee bhawine, tee o birahina manga incia tangkanamo podho-podho umane, sabutuna manga incia apewau giu imaeaaka tee apotibhaaka kahukumu mopokana tee giu madhaki mopadhana ipewauna manga incia. <verse eid="ROM 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 1:28" />Jadi mboomo tuaapa manga incia amendeu apomatau tee Aulataʼala, sumaimo Aulataʼala ataroakea o fikirina manga incia asia-sia, sabutuna manga incia apewau giu inda molaengana to ipewauna maanusia. <verse eid="ROM 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 1:29" />Ngangarandana manga incia abukeaka tee sagala giuna kadhaki, giu inda mobanara; kasoʼo, giu marombu, gigibulu, pekamateana mia, pogera-gera, pekatipu, pacilakaana mia, tee pande humbu-humbuna mia. <verse eid="ROM 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 1:30" />Manga incia o pande fitanaa, pande bancina Aulataʼala, inda mokoʼadatina, mosombona, mopekalangana karona, mohaejatiakana kadhaki, modorohakana tee mancuanana, <verse eid="ROM 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 1:31" />inda mokoʼakalana budina, inda momembalina motoparacaea, inda tee kaasina incana, tee inda momaasiakana maanusia rangana. <verse eid="ROM 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 1:32" />Manga incia amataua o tuturana hukumuna Aulataʼala, siitumo ande o mia mopewauna giu incia sumai tabeana atohukumu mate, maka moomini mboo sumai manga incia asadhaadhaa apewaua tee asatujui manga mia mosagaanana to apewau giu incia sumai.<verse eid="ROM 1:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ROM 2" />
  <para style="s1">Kahukumuna Aulataʼala to Bhari-bharia Mia</para>
  <para style="sr">
    <ref loc="ROM 2:1-16">2:1-16</ref>
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 2:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 7:1">Mat. 7:1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:37">Luk. 6:37</ref>. </char>
    </note>E manga witinaiku, incema buaka ingkomiu mbakana uhaakimu mia mosagaanana? Karomiu samia uka inda bheulapa minaaka i kasalaha wakutuuna uhaakimu mia mosagaanana, tee o giu incia sumai soo apokanamo tee uhukumu karomiu samia, roonamo opea ipewaumiu sumai apokana uka tee opea ipewauna manga incia. <verse eid="ROM 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 2:2" />Ingkita tamataua ande o kahukumuna Aulataʼala to manga mia mopewauna mboo sumai aʼadili. <verse eid="ROM 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 2:3" />Maka ingkomiu uhaakimu manga mia mopewauna giu madhaki, sainamo karomiu uka upewau mboo sumai. E manga witinaiku, bholi ufikiri umembali ulapa minaaka i kahukumuna Aulataʼala! <verse eid="ROM 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 2:4" />Bholi upandaʼente kalapena incana, kakatena totona incana tee kaogena kasabarana Aulataʼala, roonamo ingkomiu dhaanamo umataua ande o Aulataʼala sumai asusuaka kalapena incana to ingkomiu mamudhaakana utoba minaaka i dosa-dosamiu. <verse eid="ROM 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 2:5" />Maka rampaakanamo umentagali tee umendeu utoba, ingkomiu soo apokanamo tangasaana upajulu pamuruna Aulataʼala to karomiu samia sakawana o wakutuuna pamuru tee kahukumuna moʼadili sumai apatiumbaakakomiu. <verse eid="ROM 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 2:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 62:13">Zab. 62:13</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 24:12">Aar. 24:12</ref>.</char></note>Roonamo Aulataʼala bheabalasi bhari-bharia pewauna mia apokana tee opea mopadhana ipewauna. <verse eid="ROM 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 2:7" />Aulataʼala bheadhawuakea dhadhi mobakaa to manga incia inda mounto-untona mopewauna kalape, mopeelona kamuliangi, mopeelona kahoromati, tee mopeelona dhadhi inda momembalina mobinasa. <verse eid="ROM 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 2:8" />Maka o Aulataʼala bheaʼamara tee apamuru mpuu tee manga mia molabhiakana karona, inda motaʼatina tee kabanara, tee moosena dhala momadhaki. <verse eid="ROM 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 2:9" />Karasai tee kanarakaa bheakangkanai bhari-bharia mia mopewauna kadhaki i nuncana dhadhina, tee mobhaa-bhaana ikangkanai o miana Yahudi, tee uka manga mia mominaakana i lipu mosagaanana. <verse eid="ROM 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 2:10" />Maka o kamuliangi, kahoromati tee dhadhi malape bheatarimaia mia mopewauna kalape, bhaa-bhaana motarimaia o miana Yahudi, tee uka manga mia mominaakana i lipu mosagaanana. <verse eid="ROM 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 2:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 10:17">Kap. 10:17</ref>.</char></note>Roonamo Aulataʼala inda apaposala-sala mia.<verse eid="ROM 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 2:12" />Bhari-bharia mia mokodosa inda momatauna Hukumuna Taurati, siitumo hukumu modhaangiana i nuncana Kitabi Taurati, bheatoʼadili moomini inda atohukumuaka tee Hukumuna Taurati. Sainamo bhari-bharia mia mokodosa momatauna Hukumuna Taurati, bheatoʼadili aose hukumu modhaangiana i nuncana Hukumuna Taurati sumai. <verse eid="ROM 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 2:13" />Roonamo mia mobanara i aroana Aulataʼala inda soo aperangoi Hukumuna Taurati, maka o mia bhemotoabhina mobanara i aroana Aulataʼala sumai satotuuna o mia moosena hukumu modhaangiana i nuncana Hukumuna Taurati sumai. <verse eid="ROM 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 2:14" />Manga mia inda motolentuna miana Yahudi, maka ande aose Hukumuna Taurati rampaakanamo fikirina karona, sumaimo ngangarandana manga incia bhemomembalina hukumu to karona, moomini manga incia inda tee katauna tee hukumuna agamana Yahudi sumai. <verse eid="ROM 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 2:15" />Roonamo tee giu incia sumai manga incia padhamo asusuaka karona ande o Hukumuna Taurati atoburi i nuncana ngangarandana manga incia, tee o baatinina manga incia amembali sakusii ande sadia apasalea atawa apabanarea fikirina karona. <verse eid="ROM 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 2:16" />Bhari-bharia giu incia sumai bheatokamata ande akawamo wakutuuna, siitumo wakutuuna bhari-bharia rahasiana maanusia bheahaakimua Aulataʼala alaloi Al Masi, siitumo o Isa, apokana tee opea modhaangiana i nuncana Lele Malape ipakoleleakaku.<verse eid="ROM 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Hukumuna Taurati Inda Amembali Apasalaamati Miana Yahudi</para>
  <para style="sr">
    <ref loc="ROM 2:17-29">2:17-29</ref>
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 2:17" />Maka ingkomiu uabhi karomiu o miana Yahudi tee uose Hukumuna Taurati, tee ubanggaaka kaogesana Aulataʼala. <verse eid="ROM 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 2:18" />Ingkomiu umataua opea o kapeeluana Aulataʼala tee umembali upili opea molabhina kalapena, roonamo ingkomiu padhamo aadhariakakomiu Hukumuna Taurati, <verse eid="ROM 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 2:19" />tee uyaakini ande ingkomiu bhemotondana mia momawilo tee umembali kainawa to manga mia modhaangiana i nuncana kalalanda, <verse eid="ROM 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 2:20" />moadharina mia mokabhongo-bhongo, tee umembali guruna anaana maidhiidhii, roonamo ingkomiu padhamo upotibhaaka ilimuu tee kabanara minaaka i Hukumuna Taurati. <verse eid="ROM 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 2:21" />Ande mboo sumai, apokia ingkomiu uadhari mia mosagaanana, maka inda uadhari karomiu? Ingkomiu mopajelasiakana mia mamudhaakana inda amanako, maka garaaka o karomiu momanakona! <verse eid="ROM 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 2:22" />Ingkomiu mopogauna, bholi uzina, garaaka o karomiu mopewauna zinaa. Ingkomiu mobancina barahala, maka garaaka o karomiu momanakona manga bara i tampana barahala! <verse eid="ROM 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 2:23" />E ingkomiu mobanggaakana Hukumuna Taurati, apokia ingkomiu uhina Aulataʼala wakutuuna indapo uose Hukumuna Taurati sumai? <verse eid="ROM 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 2:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 52:5">Yes. 52:5</ref>.</char></note>Tee mboomo motoburina i nuncana Kitabi Momangkilo, "Rampaakanamo ingkomiu, sarona Aulataʼala ahinaia manga mia mominaakana i lipu mosagaanana inda motolentuna miana Yahudi."<verse eid="ROM 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 2:25" />
    <char style="add">Ingkita tamataua ande bhari-bharia umane mokoʼagamana Yahudi padhamo atotandaki.</char> Inciamo tandaki sumai akoguna ande ingkomiu uose Hukumuna Taurati, maka ande inda uose Hukumuna Taurati, sumaimo tandakimiu indamo tee gunana. <verse eid="ROM 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 2:26" />Ande dhaangia o mia inda mototandakina maka aose tuturana Hukumuna Taurati, sumaimo incia tabeana atoabhi mboomo mia mopadhana mototandaki. <verse eid="ROM 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 2:27" />Tee manga mia inda mototandakina sumai bheapasalakomiu, roonamo ingkomiu dhaangia tee Kitabi Mangkilomiu tee utotandaki, maka inda uose Hukumuna Taurati. Sainamo manga incia inda atotandaki, maka manga incia ataʼati Hukumuna Taurati. <verse eid="ROM 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 2:28" />Roonamo miana Yahudi asilii mencuana tangkanamo atokamata minaaka i sambalina karona, tee o maʼanana tandaki mototuu-totuuna sumai mencuana soo tanda modhaangiana i badatamea. <verse eid="ROM 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 2:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 30:6">Kap. 30:6</ref>.</char></note>Maka isarongiaka miana Yahudi asilii, siitumo o mia moosena Hukumuna Taurati i nuncana baatinina, tee isarongiaka tandaki mototuu-totuuna, siitumo tandaki modhaangiana i nuncana ngangaranda ikarajaana Rohina Aulataʼala, tee mencuana giu motoburi mboomo iparintaakana i nuncana hukumu. Mia mboo sumai bheapotibhaaka kapujia mencuana minaaka i maanusia maka minaaka i Aulataʼala.<verse eid="ROM 2:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ROM 3" />
  <para style="s1">Kalabhiana Miana Yahudi tee o Aulataʼala Sadia Amembali Atoparacaea</para>
  <para style="sr">
    <ref loc="ROM 3:1-8">3:1-8</ref>
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 3:1" />Ande mboo sumai, opea o kalabhiana miana Yahudi? Tee opea o faʼedana tandakia sumai? <verse eid="ROM 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 3:2" />Atantumo abhari mpuu o faʼedana. Mobhaa-bhaana, roonamo Aulataʼala apaparacaeaaka firimanina to miana Yahudi. <verse eid="ROM 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 3:3" />Inciamo atotuu, sagaa minaaka i manga incia inda akeniaka janjina tee Aulataʼala. Buaka o giu incia sumai bheakomaʼana ande o Aulataʼala inda akeniaka janjina? <verse eid="ROM 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 3:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 51:6">Zab. 51:6</ref>.</char></note>Atantumo inda! Aulataʼala bheatorotorosu akeniaka janjina, moomini o maanusia inda akeniaka janjina, mboomo motoburina i nuncana Kitabi Momangkilo,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:4 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">motoburina i nuncana Kitabi Momangkilo: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Raja Daud aperna aburi mboo sii i nuncana Zaburu, "To Ingkoo, tangkanamo tee Ingkoo kukodosa tee kupewau giu madhaki. Sabutuna abanara o firimanimu wakutuuna kupewau kasalaha tee uʼadili wakutuuna uhukumuaku." Maʼanana, Raja Daud afikiri tee atoba minaaka i dosana karona tee asatuju ande o Aulataʼala sadia abanara wakutuuna abhoasaka firimanina. </char></note></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:4">"Mamudhaakana akobukutii ande Ingkoo ubanara minaaka i bhari-bharia ifirimaniakamu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:4">tee Ingkoo ukana wakutuuna utohaakimu."<verse eid="ROM 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 3:5" />Maka ande o pewauta inda mobanarana sumai amembali apatinda kabanarana Aulataʼala, opea bheipogauakata? Buaka o Aulataʼala inda aʼadili wakutuuna mangahukumu? (Pogau incia sii tangkanamo adhaangia i nuncana fikirina maanusiamea.) <verse eid="ROM 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 3:6" />Atantumo inda! Roonamo ande Aulataʼala inda adili, tantumo Incia inda amembali ahaakimu dunia. <verse eid="ROM 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 3:7" />Maka ande roonamo kagau-gauku imembaliakana kabanarana Aulataʼala ahanda atokamata tee ajulu atomuliangi, apokia iaku dhaangiapo uka kutohaakimu mboomo mia mokodosa? <verse eid="ROM 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 3:8" />Apokia ingkita inda tapogau, "Maimo tapewauaka kadhaki mamudhaakana aumba o giu momalape"? Inciamo ingkami tee mangafitanaana tee mangapogauakana ande ingkami padhamo tapogau mboo sumai, garaaka inda. Manga mia momangafitanaana mboo sumai alaenga apotibhaaka kahukumuna Aulataʼala!<verse eid="ROM 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bhari-bharia Maanusia Akodosa</para>
  <para style="sr">
    <ref loc="ROM 3:9-20">3:9-20</ref>
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 3:9" />Jadi tuaapa? Buaka alabhi amalape ingkami tee mia inda motolentuna miana Yahudi? Inda! Roonamo ingkami padhamo tapogau tee bhari-bharia mia, malape i miana Yahudi atawa i miana Yunani, ande bhari-bharia manga incia akodosa, <verse eid="ROM 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 3:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:10-12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 14:1-3">Zab. 14:1-3</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 53:2-4">53:2-4</ref>.</char></note>mboomo mopadhana motoburina i nuncana Kitabi Momangkilo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:10">"Inda dhaangia o mia mobanarana dhadhina.<verse eid="ROM 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 3:11" />Inda dhaangia o mia momembalina modhadhina tee kalapena budina,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:11">tee inda dhaangia o mia mototuu-totuuna mopeelona Aulataʼala.<verse eid="ROM 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 3:12" />Bhari-bharia mia apekaridho karona minaaka i Aulataʼala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:12">tee bhari-bharia manga incia inda tee gunana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:12">Inda samia uka o mia mopewauna kalape,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:12">moomini samia uka."<verse eid="ROM 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 3:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:13 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 5:10">Zab. 5:10</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 140:4">140:4</ref>.</char>
    </note>"Goncona manga incia mboomo koburu moponganga.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:13">Dhelana manga incia apekatipu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:13">Bhiwina manga incia apekafitanaa mboomo ulo mokobisa."<verse eid="ROM 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 3:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:14 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 10:7">Zab. 10:7</ref>.</char>
    </note>"Muncuna manga incia abukeaka katunda tee kabancia."<verse eid="ROM 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 3:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:15-17 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 59:7-8">Yes. 59:7-8</ref>. </char>
    </note>"Bhengkalana manga incia amadhei ande bheasikisaa tee apekamate mia.<verse eid="ROM 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 3:16" />Iapaipo uka o lingkaana manga incia, modhaangiana tangkanamo kahancuru tee kanarakaa,<verse eid="ROM 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 3:17" />tee manga incia inda amatau dhalana dhadhi momalape."<verse eid="ROM 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 3:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:18 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 36:2">Zab. 36:2</ref>.</char>
    </note>"Manga incia inda amaeka tee Aulataʼala."<verse eid="ROM 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 3:19" />Sii-sii tamataua ande bhari-bharia giu motoburina i nuncana Kitabi Taurati adhawuakea to manga mia moosena Hukumuna Taurati, mamudhaakana o muncuna bhari-bharia mia atosoncongi, tee saangua dunia adhaangia i tambena kahaakimuna Aulataʼala. <verse eid="ROM 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 3:20" />Roonamo inda samia uka o maanusia motoabhina mobanara i aroana Aulataʼala rampaakanamo aose kaadharina Hukumuna Taurati, maka o Hukumuna Tauratimo sumai isadaraakata minaaka i dosata.<verse eid="ROM 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Maanusia Apabanarea Aulataʼala Roonamo Kaparacaeana</para>
  <para style="sr">
    <ref loc="ROM 3:21-31">3:21-31</ref>
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 3:21" />Maka sii-sii o Aulataʼala padhamo asusuaka dhalana to maanusia mamudhaakana atopabanara i aroana. Giu incia sii mencuana rampaakanamo ingkita taose Hukumuna Taurati, moomini o Kitabi Taurati tee kitabina manga nabii padhamo adhawuaka kasakusiina to giu incia sumai. <verse eid="ROM 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 3:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 2:16">Gal. 2:16</ref>.</char></note><char style="add">Kitabi Momangkilo aadhariaka ande</char> maanusia amembali atoabhi abanara i aroana Aulataʼala minaaka i kaparacaeana tee Isa Al Masi. Giu incia sii apewaua Aulataʼala to bhari-bharia mia moparacaeana tee Isa Al Masi, tee inda apaposala-sala <char style="add">miana Yahudi tee mia inda motolentuna miana Yahudi. </char> <verse eid="ROM 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 3:23" />Roonamo bhari-bharia mia akodosamo tee amaridhomo minaaka i kamuliangina Aulataʼala. <verse eid="ROM 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 3:24" />Maka roonamo rahumatina Aulataʼala, maanusia atoabhi abanara i aroana Aulataʼala alaloi katolosina minaaka i Isa Al Masi. <verse eid="ROM 3:24" /><verse number="25-26" style="v" sid="ROM 3:25-26" />Aulataʼala padhamo apatotapuaka Isa Al Masi to apamembalia kurubanina poʼamania alaloi matena to manga mia moparacaeaia. Giu incia sumai to asusuaka kabanarana. Roonamo i nuncana kasabarana, Incia padhamo ataroaka dosa-dosana maanusia minaaka i piamo itu <char style="add">maka o Aulataʼala aʼadili, jadi Incia tabeana ahukumu mia mopewauna dosa.</char> Maʼanana giu incia sumai mamudhaakana o Aulataʼala asusuaka kabanarana to manga mia i zamani sii-sii, tee cara incia sumai o Aulataʼala amembali asusuaka karona ande Incia abanara, tee uka aabhi manga mia moparacaeana tee Isa abanara.<verse eid="ROM 3:25-26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 3:27" />Ande mboo sumai opea o alasana maanusia to abanggaaka karona? Inda tee alasana! Buaka o maanusia amembali apomalape tee Aulataʼala rampaakanamo aose Hukumuna Taurati? Inda amembali! Maka momembalina mopapomalapena pokaiana maanusia tee Aulataʼala tangkanamo moparacaeana tee Isa Al Masi. <verse eid="ROM 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 3:28" />Roonamo ingkami tayaakini, ande o maanusia atoabhi abanara i aroana Aulataʼala roonamo soo aparacaea tee Isa Al Masi tee mencuana rampaakanamo aose Hukumuna Taurati. <verse eid="ROM 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 3:29" />Buaka o Aulataʼala sumai tangkanamo Aulataʼalana miana Yahudi, atawa Incia uka o Aulataʼalana mia inda motolentuna miana Yahudi? Atantumo Incia o Aulataʼalana bhari-bharia mia. <verse eid="ROM 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 3:30" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 6:4">Kap. 6:4</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 3:20">Gal. 3:20</ref>.</char></note>Roonamo Aulataʼala sumai sakaro-karona, sumaimo Incia bheaabhi manga mia abanara rampaakanamo iimanina tee Isa, malape o mia mototandaki atawa o mia inda mototandaki.<verse eid="ROM 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 3:31" />Ande mboo sumai, buaka rampaakanamo iimanimami tee Isa Al Masi mbakana tamembali tapanainda Hukumuna Taurati? Atantumo inda! Maka tee iimanimami sumai, ingkami tahanda taharagaangi Hukumuna Taurati sumai.<verse eid="ROM 3:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ROM 4" />
  <para style="s1">Nabii Ibrahim Atopabanara roonamo Aparacaea tee Aulataʼala</para>
  <para style="sr">
    <ref loc="ROM 4:1-12">4:1-12</ref>
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 4:1" />Jadi opea bheipogauakata tee dhadhina Nabii Ibrahim opu-opuata sumai? <verse eid="ROM 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 4:2" />Ande o Nabii Ibrahim atoabhi abanara i aroana Aulataʼala roonamo pewauna, sumaimo dhaangia saangu giu momembalina ibanggaakana karona, maka inda mboo sumai i aroana Aulataʼala. <verse eid="ROM 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 4:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 15:6">Bhaa. 15:6</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 3:6">Gal. 3:6</ref>.</char></note>Roonamo i nuncana Kitabi Momangkilo atoburi, "Nabii Ibrahim aparacaea tee Aulataʼala, tee rampaakanamo giu incia sumai Aulataʼala aabhia amembali mia mobanara." <verse eid="ROM 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 4:4" />Mia mokarajaa atantumo apotibhaaka ponambo, tee o ponambona sumai inda aabhia mboomo hadia, maka aabhia amembali hakuna. <verse eid="ROM 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 4:5" />Sainamo mia inda mokarajaa, maka aparacaea tee Aulataʼala moabhina mia modorohaka abanara, sumaimo Aulataʼala bheatarima mia incia sumai rampaakanamo kaparacaeana. <verse eid="ROM 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 4:6" />Apokana uka mboomo mopadhana iburina Raja Daud to pokaiana mia ipabanarana Aulataʼala mencuana rampaakanamo opea mopadhana ipewauna,<verse eid="ROM 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 4:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:7-8 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 32:1-2">Zab. 32:1-2</ref>.</char>
    </note>"Akaunde-undemo manga mia</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 4:7">motoʼamponina manga kasalahana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 4:7">tee itutubhina manga dosana.<verse eid="ROM 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 4:8" />Amasanaamo maanusia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 4:8">roonamo dosana inda agagaria Kawasana Opu."<verse eid="ROM 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 4:9" />Buaka o bhoasaka "kaunde-unde" minaaka i Raja Daud sumai tangkanamo apatujuakea to mia mototandakimea? Atawa to mia inda mototandaki? Ingkami padhamo tapogauakea, ande o kaparacaeana Nabii Ibrahim alentua amembali kabanara. <verse eid="ROM 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 4:10" />Naepia o Aulataʼala apepuu alentu giu incia sumai to Nabii Ibrahim, sapadhana atotandaki atawa wakutuuna indapo atotandaki? Wakutuuna indapo atotandaki, mencuana sapadhana atotandaki! <verse eid="ROM 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 4:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 17:10">Bhaa. 17:10</ref>.</char></note>Ande mboo sumai, tandaki itarimana Nabii Ibrahim soo amembali materaina kabanara rampaakanamo iimanina, siitumo opea ipotibhaakana wakutuuna indapo atotandaki. Tee mboo sumai, Nabii Ibrahim amembalimo amana bhari-bharia mia moparacaeana tee Aulataʼala, atolentu uka to manga mia indapo mototandaki, mamudhaakana o kabanara sumai atolentuaka uka to manga incia. <verse eid="ROM 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 4:12" />Tee incia uka amembali amana bhari-bharia mia mototandaki, tee mencuana soo mototandakinamea, maka moparacaeana uka tee iimanina Nabii Ibrahim opu-opuata i wakutuuna incia indapo atotandaki.<verse eid="ROM 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nabii Ibrahim Atarima Janjina Aulataʼala Rampaakanamo Kaparacaeana tee Aulataʼala</para>
  <para style="sr">
    <ref loc="ROM 4:13-25">4:13-25</ref>
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 4:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:13 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 17:4-6">Bhaa. 17:4-6</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 22:17-18">22:17-18</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 3:29">Gal. 3:29</ref>.</char>
    </note>Aulataʼala apojanji tee Nabii Ibrahim tee siwuluna, ande o dunia sii bheamembali pewauana manga incia. Aulataʼala apojanji mboo sumai mencuana rampaakanamo Nabii Ibrahim ataʼati tee Hukumuna Taurati, maka roonamo incia aparacaea tee Aulataʼala, sabutuna o Nabii Ibrahim atarimaia Aulataʼala amembali mia mobanara. <verse eid="ROM 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 4:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 3:18">Gal. 3:18</ref>.</char></note>Roonamo ande tangkanamo soo mia motaʼatina tee Hukumuna Tauratimea bhemotarimana opea ijanjiakana Aulataʼala, sumaimo bheasia-siamo kaparacaeata tee Aulataʼala, tee o janjina Aulataʼala uka abatalamo. <verse eid="ROM 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 4:15" />Rampaakanamo sumai o Hukumuna Taurati aumbaaka pamuruna Aulataʼala, maka ande i saangu tampa inda tee Hukumuna Taurati, sumaimo inda dhaangia uka o kasalaha.<verse eid="ROM 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 4:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:16 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GAL 3:7">Gal. 3:7</ref>.</char>
    </note>Jadi o janjina Aulataʼala sumai aminaaka i kaparacaeata tee Incia, mamudhaakana aincana ande o janji sumai aminaaka i rahumati, sabutuna o janji sumai akawa to bhari-bharia siwuluna Nabii Ibrahim. Jadi mencuana tangkanamo to manga incia moosena Hukumuna Tauratimea, maka to manga incia moosena iimanina Nabii Ibrahim uka, roonamo Nabii Ibrahim opu-opuata bhari-bharikita. <verse eid="ROM 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 4:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 17:5">Bhaa. 17:5</ref>.</char></note>Giu incia sumai mboomo mopadhana motoburina i nuncana Kitabi Momangkilo to Nabii Ibrahim, "Iaku padhamo kuangkako to umembaliaka opu-opuana lipu mobhari." Nabii Ibrahim aparacaea tee pogauna Aulataʼala sumai, roonamo amataua ande o Aulataʼala amembali apadhadhi mia mate, tee o parintana amembali apadhaangia manga giu indapo modhaangia amembali adhaangia. <verse eid="ROM 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 4:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 15:5">Bhaa. 15:5</ref>.</char></note>Nabii Ibrahim atorotorosu aharapu tee aparacaea moomini indamo dhaangia momembalina iharapu, sabutuna incia amembali opu-opuana lipu mobhari apokana tee opea mopadhana motoburina i nuncana Kitabi Momangkilo, "Siwulumu bheabhari mpuu naile itu." <verse eid="ROM 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 4:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 17:17">Bhaa. 17:17</ref>.</char></note>Kaparacaeana Nabii Ibrahim asadhaadhaa moomini o umuruna kera-kera saatu taomo tee amataua ande o badana amalutemo mboomo mia mate, tee o Sarah bhawinena uka akomba. <verse eid="ROM 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 4:20" />Maka incia asadhaadhaa aparacaea tee inda ameri wakutuuna audhani janjina Aulataʼala tee o iimanina ahanda amatangka, tee incia amuliangi Aulataʼala. <verse eid="ROM 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 4:21" />Incia ayaakini mpuu ande o Aulataʼala amembali apewau opea mopadhana ijanjiakana. <verse eid="ROM 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 4:22" />Rampaakanamo sumai, Aulataʼala aabhi Nabii Ibrahim mboomo samia o mia mobanara. <verse eid="ROM 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 4:23" />Bhoasaka, "Atarimaia Aulataʼala amembali mia mobanara," mencuana tangkanamo soo atoburiaka to Nabii Ibrahim, <verse eid="ROM 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 4:24" />maka atoburiaka uka to ingkita. Jadi o giu incia sumai bhealentua Aulataʼala roonamo taparacaea tee Incia mopadhana mopadhadhina pendua Isa Oputa Momalanga minaaka i mate. <verse eid="ROM 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 4:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:4-5">Yes. 53:4-5</ref>.</char></note>Isa padhamo atopasaraakaaka to atopekamate roonamo manga dosata, tee Incia atopadhadhi pendua minaaka i mate mamudhaakana ingkita tamembali tatopabanara i aroana Aulataʼala.<verse eid="ROM 4:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ROM 5" />
  <para style="s1">Tapomalape tee Aulataʼala Rampaakanamo Isa Al Masi</para>
  <para style="sr">
    <ref loc="ROM 5:1-11">5:1-11</ref>
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 5:1" />Ingkita tatoabhi tabanara i aroana Aulataʼala roonamo kaparacaeata tee Isa, sumaimo ingkita tadhadhi tapomalape tee Aulataʼala alaloi Isa Al Masi Oputa Momalanga. <verse eid="ROM 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 5:2" />Rampaakanamo taparacaea tee Isa, sumaimo Incia mangadhawuaka rahumatina Aulataʼala, tee o rahumatimo incia sumai idhadhiakata sii-sii. Tee uka tabangga roonamo kaharaputa bheimembaliakata bhetapotibhaaka kamuliangina Aulataʼala. <verse eid="ROM 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 5:3" />Mencuana soo incia sumai! Ingkita uka bhetabangga i nuncana kanarakaa, roonamo tamataua ande o kanarakaa sumai aumbaaka kasabara. <verse eid="ROM 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 5:4" />Sapadhana incia sumai, kasabara aumbaaka katangkana inca, tee o katangkana inca aumbaaka kaharapu. <verse eid="ROM 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 5:5" />Tee o kaharapu incia sumai inda bheamaidhiidhiakea incata, roonamo kaasina Aulataʼala sumai padhamo aantokia i nuncana ngangarandata alaloi Rohina Aulataʼala mopadhana irahumatiakana to ingkita. <verse eid="ROM 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 5:6" />Wakutuuna inda tee kakaata, Isa Al Masi mangamateaka i wakutuu mopadhana itantuakana Aulataʼala, garaaka ingkita manga mia mokodosa. <verse eid="ROM 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 5:7" />Roonamo amesagala o mia moundana mokurubaniakana karona to apasalaamatiaka mia mobanara, moomini koroo dhaangia uka o mia mobaranina mokurubaniakana karona to mia momalape. <verse eid="ROM 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 5:8" />Maka o Aulataʼala mangasusuaka kaasina wakutuuna Al Masi mangamateaka tee o kadhaangiata dhaangiapo takodosa.<verse eid="ROM 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 5:9" />Sii-sii o Aulataʼala mangaabhimo tabanara alaloi raana Al Masi; rampaakanamo sumai o Isa dhaanamo mangapasalaamati uka minaaka i pamuruna Aulataʼala. <verse eid="ROM 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 5:10" />Roonamo wakutuuna dhaangiapo tamembali musuna Aulataʼala, ingkita padhamo mangapapomalape alaloi matena Anana sumai, ntaranamo uka sii-sii ingkita tapomalapemo pendua tee Aulataʼala, atantumo ingkita bheamangapasalaamati uka alaloi dhadhina Anana. <verse eid="ROM 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 5:11" />Mencuana soo incia sumai! Maka ingkita uka amembali tabangga roonamo kalapena Aulataʼala alaloi Isa Al Masi Oputa Momalanga, roonamo Incia imembaliakata tapomalape pendua tee Aulataʼala.<verse eid="ROM 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Posalana Nabii Adamu tee Isa Al Masi</para>
  <para style="sr">
    <ref loc="ROM 5:12-21">5:12-21</ref>
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 5:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:12 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 3:6">Bhaa. 3:6</ref>.</char>
    </note>Dosa apesua i nuncana dunia alaloi Nabii Adamu, tee o dosa incia sumai moumbaakana mate, sabutuna o mate sumai akangkanai bhari-bharia maanusia, roonamo bhari-bharia maanusia padhamo apewau dosa. <verse eid="ROM 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 5:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 4:15">Rom. 4:15</ref>.</char></note>Satotuuna kuasana dosa adhaangiamo i nuncana dunia sii wakutuuna maanusia indapo arango Hukumuna Taurati. Maka o Aulataʼala inda aabhi dosa sumai mboomo saangu kasalaha, roonamo maanusia indapo arango kaadhari modhaangiana i nuncana Hukumuna Taurati. <verse eid="ROM 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 5:14" />Moomini mboo sumai, mate adhaangiamo apepuu minaaka i zamanina Nabii Adamu sakawana i zamanina Nabii Musa, sampe manga mia inda mopewauna dosa mboomo ipewauna Nabii Adamu uka amate. Nabii Adamu satotuuna o ibaratina gambarana Al Masi bhemoumbana naile itu.<verse eid="ROM 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 5:15" />Maka o rahumatina Aulataʼala inda amembali atopapokana tee dosa ipewauna Nabii Adamu. Roonamo ande o kasalahana Nabii Adamu amembali amateakea mia bhari, sumaimo bhealabhi mpuu o kaogena rahumatina Aulataʼala tee kadhawu idhawuakana to mia bhari alaloi samia maanusia, siitumo Isa Al Masi. <verse eid="ROM 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 5:16" />Rahumatina Aulataʼala sumai inda amembali atopapokana tee giu moumbana molaloina mia mopernana mopewauna dosa. Roonamo kahaakimuna saangu kasalaha sumai bheaumbaaka kahukumu, maka o rahumatina Aulataʼala mominaakana i kasalaha mobhari sumai aumbaaka carana Aulataʼala to apabanara mia. <verse eid="ROM 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 5:17" />Roonamo alaloi dosana samia maanusia, bhari-bharia maanusia akuasaia mate, <char style="add">ibaratina mboomo raja momadhakina pewauna mopisakina raʼeatina.</char> Ntaranamo uka manga incia motarimana kabanara minaaka i rahumati motaralabhi-labhi sumai bheakokuasa i nuncana dhadhina alaloi samia maanusia, siitumo Isa Al Masi.<verse eid="ROM 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 5:18" />Jadi apokana mboomo dosana samia maanusia imembaliakana bhari-bharia mia apotibhaaka kahukumu, mboo sumai uka tee pewau mobanara minaaka i samia maanusia imembaliakana bhari-bharia mia atopabanara, sabutuna manga incia apotibhaaka dhadhi mobakaa. <verse eid="ROM 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 5:19" />Roonamo apokana mboomo kadorohakana samia maanusia imembaliakana mia bhari akodosa, mboomo uka tee kataʼatina samia maanusia imembaliakana mia bhari amembali atopabanara.<verse eid="ROM 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 5:20" />Hukumuna Taurati atodhawuaka to maanusia, mamudhaakana o dosana maanusia sahandana abhari. Maka sahandana kabharina dosana maanusia, rahumatina Aulataʼala uka sahandana ataralabhi-labhi. <verse eid="ROM 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 5:21" />I piamo itu o dosa akokuasa to bhari-bharia maanusia tee mangabhawa i mate. Maka o rahumatina Aulataʼala apekatalo dosa tee akuasai ngangarandata sabutuna ingkita tatoabhi tabanara i aroana Aulataʼala. Rampaakanamo sumai, ingkita tapotibhaaka dhadhi mobakaa alaloi Isa Al Masi, Oputa Momalanga.<verse eid="ROM 5:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ROM 6" />
  <para style="s1">Mateta tee Dhadhita Apokana tee Isa Al Masi</para>
  <para style="sr">
    <ref loc="ROM 6:1-14">6:1-14</ref>
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 6:1" />Jadi opea bheipewauta sapadhana tapotibhaaka rahumatina Aulataʼala? Buaka ingkita tabeana tatorotorosu tapewau dosa mamudhaakana o Aulataʼala ahanda mangadhawuaka rahumatina? <verse eid="ROM 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 6:2" />Atantumo inda! Roonamo ande tamate tapoose tee Isa, maʼanana o kuasana dosa padhamo apanaindaia to ingkita. Atantumo ingkita bholi tatorotorosu tadhadhi i nuncana dosa mboomo wakutuuna ingkita indapo taose Al Masi! <verse eid="ROM 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 6:3" />Tee ingkomiu umataua ande wakutuuna bhari-bharikita tatopapebhaho mamudhaakana taposaangu tee Isa Al Masi, ingkita tamatemo tapoose tee Incia. <verse eid="ROM 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 6:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 2:12">Kol. 2:12</ref>.</char></note>Maʼanana o kapapebhahoka sumai amembali tanda ande ingkita tamatemo tee tatokoburumo tapoose tee Al Masi. Tee wakutuuna Aulataʼala apake kuasana momulia to apadhadhiaka Isa pendua, ingkita uka tatopadhadhimo pendua i nuncana dhadhi mobhaau.<verse eid="ROM 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 6:5" />Roonamo ande taposaangu tee Isa, tee tamate tapobhawa-bhawa tee Incia, sumaimo ingkita bhetapoose tee Incia, tee tapokana tatopadhadhi pendua tee Incia. <verse eid="ROM 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 6:6" />Ingkita tamataua ande o karota momangengena padhamo atoloe i kau salib apobhawa tee Al Masi, mamudhaakana o kuasana dosa modhaangiana i nuncana karota atopahancuru, sabutuna inda mangapabhatua dosata. <verse eid="ROM 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 6:7" />Roonamo incema momatena, incia padhamo atopabebasi minaaka i kuasana dosana.<verse eid="ROM 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 6:8" />Maka ande tamate tapoose tee Al Masi, ingkita taparacaea ande bhetadhadhi tapoose tee Incia uka. <verse eid="ROM 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 6:9" />Ingkita tamataua ande o Al Masi mopadhana motopadhadhina pendua minaaka i tanga-tangana mia mate, inda bheamate pendua. Tee o mate indamo tee kuasana to karona. <verse eid="ROM 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 6:10" />Roonamo Al Masi amate to dosa tee o matena sampearomea to saʼumurua, maka sii-sii Incia adhadhimo, tee o dhadhina to Aulataʼala. <verse eid="ROM 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 6:11" />Ingkomiu uka tabeana uabhi karomiu umate to dosa, maka udhadhi to Aulataʼala alaloi Isa Al Masi.<verse eid="ROM 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 6:12" />Rampaakanamo sumai, bholi utaroakea o dosa akuasai badamiu mofanaana sumai, mamudhaakana inda uose kapeeluana badamiu. <verse eid="ROM 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 6:13" />Bholi upasaraakaaka manga parewana badamiu i kuasana dosa tee upakea to haejati madhaki. Maka upasaraakaakamea o karomiu to Aulataʼala mboomo manga mia mopadhana ipadhadhina pendua minaaka i mate, tee upasaraakaakamea manga parewana badamiu to Aulataʼala mamudhaakana upakea to manga giu mobanara. <verse eid="ROM 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 6:14" />Ingkomiu indamo bheamembali akuasaikomiu dosa, roonamo indamo udhadhi uose Hukumuna Taurati, maka udhadhi i tambena rahumatina Aulataʼala.<verse eid="ROM 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Rua Giu Kapabhatua</para>
  <para style="sr">
    <ref loc="ROM 6:15-23">6:15-23</ref>
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 6:15" />Jadi tuaapa? Buaka ingkita bhetapewau dosa, kaapaaka ingkita indamo tadhadhi i tambena Hukumuna Taurati, maka tadhadhimo i tambena rahumatina Aulataʼala? Atantumo inda! <verse eid="ROM 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 6:16" />Ingkomiu dhaanamo umataua, ande bheupasaraakaaka karomiu to umembali bhatuana mia mosagaanana, ingkomiu bheumembali bhatuana mia itaʼatimiu sumai; malape umembali bhatuana dosa to mokapalaikomiu uporopeaka i dhala i mateaka atawa o bhatuana kataʼati to mokapalaikomiu uporopeaka i dhalana kabanara. <verse eid="ROM 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 6:17" />Maka usukurumo tee Aulataʼala, roonamo i piamo itu ingkomiu umembali manga bhatuana dosa, maka sii-sii tee kampuu-mpuuna incamiu uose kaadhari mobanara mopadhana iadhariakana to ingkomiu. <verse eid="ROM 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 6:18" />Ingkomiu padhamo utopabebasi minaaka i dosa, tee sii-sii umembalimo manga bhatuana kabanara.<verse eid="ROM 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 6:19" />Iaku kupake pogau polanciringa mobiasana ipakena mia mamudhaakana umasimba umaʼanai opea ipogauakaku. Roonamo i piamo itu ingkomiu upasaraakaaka bhari-bharia parewana badamiu to umembaliaka manga bhatuana manga giu momarombu tee giu momadhaki moumbaakana kadhaki. Maka sii-sii ingkomiu tabeana upasaraakaaka bhari-bharia parewana badamiu sumai to umembaliaka manga bhatuana kabanara moumbaakana kangkilo.<verse eid="ROM 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 6:20" />Wakutuuna dhaangiapo apabhatuakomiu dosa, inda dhaangia o fikirimiu to udhadhi uose dhalana kabanara. <verse eid="ROM 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 6:21" />Maka o faʼedana opea ipotibhaakamiu minaaka i manga giu imembaliakamiu umaea sii-sii? Roonamo kapadhaana minaaka i bhari-bharia giu incia sumai soo aumbaaka mate. <verse eid="ROM 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 6:22" />Maka sii-sii ingkomiu ubebasimo minaaka i dosa tee umembalimo manga bhatuana Aulataʼala, sabutuna ingkomiu upotibhaaka faʼeda moumbaakana kangkilo tee o kapadhaana upotibhaaka dhadhi mobakaa. <verse eid="ROM 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 6:23" />Roonamo ponambona dosa sumai o mate, maka o rahumatina Aulataʼala sumai o dhadhi mobakaa mominaakana i Isa Al Masi Oputa Momalanga.<verse eid="ROM 6:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ROM 7" />
  <para style="s1">Tabebasi minaaka i Hukumuna Taurati Mamudhaakana Talaiani Aulataʼala tee Cara Mobhaau Mopadhana Ipatotapuakana Rohina Aulataʼala</para>
  <para style="sr">
    <ref loc="ROM 7:1-12">7:1-12</ref>
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 7:1" />E manga witinaiku, ingkomiu momatauna Hukumuna Taurati; atantumo ingkomiu umataua ande o kuasana hukumu akuasai samia maanusia tangkanamo kangengena maanusia incia sumai dhaangiapo adhadhi. <verse eid="ROM 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 7:2" />Polanciringana mboomo samia bhawine mokoumane, incia dhaangiapo atobhoke tee hukumu wakutuuna o umanena sumai dhaangiapo adhadhi. Maka ande o umanena sumai amatemo, bhawinena sumai alapamo minaaka i hukumu mobhokea. <verse eid="ROM 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 7:3" />Jadi ande o umanena dhaangiapo adhadhi, tee o bhawine incia sumai akawimo tee umane mosagaanana, incia bheatoabhi apewau zina. Maka ande o umanena mobhaa-bhaana amatemo, sumaimo incia abebasimo minaaka i hukumu, sabutuna ande akawi tee umane mosagaanana, sumaimo incia indamo atoabhi apewau zina.<verse eid="ROM 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 7:4" />E manga witinaiku, mboomo sumai uka tee ingkomiu; ingkomiu umate to Hukumuna Taurati alaloi badana Al Masi, sabutuna ingkomiu umembalimo pewauana "mia mosagaanana," siitumo Incia mopadhana motopadhadhina pendua minaaka i tanga-tangana mia mate. Tee mboo sumai, ingkita tamembali talaiani Aulataʼala. <verse eid="ROM 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 7:5" />Wakutuuna dhaangiapo taose kapeeluata to tapewau dosa mboomo biasana ipewauna maanusia, sumaimo Hukumuna Taurati mangapatiumbaaka kapeelu i nuncana karota mamudhaakana tapewau dosa. Manga kapeelu incia sumai mangabhawa to tapewauaka giu imateaka. <verse eid="ROM 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 7:6" />I piamo itu ingkita tatobhoke tee Hukumuna Taurati, maka sii-sii ingkita tatopabebasimo minaaka i hukumu incia sumai, roonamo ingkita tamate to Hukumuna Taurati, tee mboo sumai ingkita tamembalimo talaiani Aulataʼala tee cara mobhaau mboomo mopadhana ipatotapuakana Rohina Aulataʼala, tee indamo taose hukumu momangenge mopadhana motoburi.<verse eid="ROM 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 7:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:7 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 20:17">Limb. 20:17</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:21">Kap. 5:21</ref>.</char>
    </note>Ande mboo sumai opea momembalina bheipogauakata? Buaka o Hukumuna Taurati sumai o dosa? Atantumo inda! Maka rampaakanamo Hukumuna Taurati iaku kumataua opea o dosa sumai. Roonamo ande o Hukumuna Taurati inda apogauaka, "Bholi umasibuaka pewauana mia mosagaanana," iaku inda bhekumataua ande o kasibu sumai o dosa. <verse eid="ROM 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 7:8" />Tee o dosa apotibhaaka kalalesa alaloi Hukumuna Taurati to apamembaliaku kumasibuaka pegiu-giuna kapeelu inda momalape. Jadi ande o Hukumuna Taurati sumai inda dhaangia, sumaimo dosa uka amate. <verse eid="ROM 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 7:9" />I piamo itu iaku kudhadhi indapo kumatau Hukumuna Taurati, maka sarangoku manga parinta incia sumai, apepuumo o dosa akuasai karoku <verse eid="ROM 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 7:10" />tee iaku kumate. Parinta incia sumai tabeana aumbaaka dhadhi, maka garaaka soo aumbaaka mate to karoku. <verse eid="ROM 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 7:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 3:13">Bhaa. 3:13</ref>.</char></note>Roonamo alaloi parinta incia sumai o dosa apotibhaaka kalalesa to atipuaku, sabutuna alaloi parinta incia sumai uka o dosa apekamateaku. <verse eid="ROM 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 7:12" />Jadi o Hukumuna Taurati sumai amangkilo, tee manga parintana uka amangkilo, abanara tee amalape.<verse eid="ROM 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Potagalia Modhaangiana i Nuncana Karona Maanusia</para>
  <para style="sr">
    <ref loc="ROM 7:13-25">7:13-25</ref>
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 7:13" />Ande mboo sumai, buaka o Hukumuna Taurati momalape mopekamateaku? Atantumo inda! Maka o dosamo sumai mopekamateaku alaloi giu momalape mamudhaakana kumataua tuaapa o sifatuna dosa i nuncana karoku, tee aincana uka ande o dosa sumai apake parinta momalape to apamembaliaku kupewau dosa molabhina kabharina. <verse eid="ROM 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 7:14" />Ingkita tamataua ande o Hukumuna Taurati aminaaka i rohi, sainamo iaku o maanusia biasa mominaakana i dagi, tee iaku kumembalimo bhatuana dosa. <verse eid="ROM 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 7:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 5:17">Gal. 5:17</ref>.</char></note>Sampe opea ipewauku uka sii iaku inda kumataua, roonamo iaku inda kupewau giu ipeeluku karoku, maka kupewau giu ibanciku. <verse eid="ROM 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 7:16" />Ande kupewau giu inda ipeeluku karoku, maʼanana iaku kuʼakuia ande o Hukumuna Taurati sumai abanara. <verse eid="ROM 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 7:17" />Jadi mencuanamo iaku mopewauna manga giu momadhaki sumai, maka o dosa modhaangiana i nuncana karoku mopewaua. <verse eid="ROM 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 7:18" />Roonamo kumataua ande i nuncana karoku modhadhina moosena kapeeluana dunia sii, inda dhaangia momalapena. Sababuna dhaangia tee kapeeluku to kupewau giu momalape, maka o giu incia sumai inda amembali kupewaua. <verse eid="ROM 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 7:19" />Roonamo iaku inda kupewau giu momalape mboomo kapeeluaku, maka kupewau giu momadhaki inda ipeeluku karoku. <verse eid="ROM 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 7:20" />Sabutuna ande kupewau opea inda ipeeluku, sumaimo mencuana iaku mopewaua, maka o dosa modhaangiana i nuncana karoku mopewaua.<verse eid="ROM 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 7:21" />Jadi mboomo sii o kaadharina hukumu ipotibhaakaku: Moomini gauku kupewau giu momalape, maka modhaangiana i karoku tangkanamo giu momadhaki! <verse eid="ROM 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 7:22" />Roonamo baatiniku amaasiaka hukumuna Aulataʼala, <verse eid="ROM 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 7:23" />maka kusadaria, ande i nuncana parewana badaku dhaangia tee hukumu mosagaanana mopoewangina tee akalana budiku, sabutuna kutobhoke i nuncana hukumuna dosa modhaangiana i nuncana parewana badaku karoku. <verse eid="ROM 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 7:24" />Iaku satotuuna o maanusia mocilaka! Incema buaka bhemopasalaamatiaku minaaka i badaku moumbaakana mate sii? <verse eid="ROM 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 7:25" />Iaku kusukuru i Aulataʼala alaloi Isa Al Masi Oputa Momalanga! Jadi iaku kulaiani hukumuna Aulataʼala tangkanamo tee akalana budiku, sainamo kamaanusiaku alaiani kapeeluna hukumuna dosa.<verse eid="ROM 7:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ROM 8" />
  <para style="s1">Tadhadhi roonamo Rohina Aulataʼala</para>
  <para style="sr">
    <ref loc="ROM 8:1-17">8:1-17</ref>
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 8:1" />Rampaakanamo sumai, sii-sii indamo dhaangia o kahukumu to manga incia modhadhina moposaanguna tee Isa Al Masi, <verse eid="ROM 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 8:2" />roonamo Rohina Aulataʼala mangapamembalina tadhadhiaka taposaangu tee Isa Al Masi mopadhana mopabebasiko minaaka i hukumu moumbaakana dosa tee mate. <verse eid="ROM 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 8:3" />Aulataʼala padhamo apewau opea inda momembalina ipewauna Hukumuna Taurati roonamo maanusia inda tee kapoolina, mbakana o Aulataʼala alamboko Anana karona. Tee aala bhanguna maanusia ikuasaina dosa, Anana sumai apamembalia kurubanina dosa, rampaakanamo sumai o Aulataʼala padhamo apekatalo kuasana dosa modhaangiana i nuncana karona maanusia. <verse eid="ROM 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 8:4" />Aulataʼala apewau mboo sumai mamudhaakana opea ifirimaniakana i nuncana tuturana Hukumuna Taurati sumai amembali atopamondo i nuncana karota modhadhina moosena kapeeluana Rohina Aulataʼala, tee indamo taose kapeeluata karota. <verse eid="ROM 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 8:5" />Manga mia modhadhina moosena kapeeluana karona, atorotorosu afikiriaka opea ipeeluna karona, maka manga mia modhadhina moosena kapeeluana Rohina Aulataʼala atorotorosu afikiriaka opea ipeeluna Rohina Aulataʼala. <verse eid="ROM 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 8:6" />Roonamo fikirina mia moosena kapeeluana karona bheapotibhaaka mate, maka o fikirina mia moosena kapeeluana Rohina Aulataʼala bheapotibhaaka dhadhi momalape. <verse eid="ROM 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 8:7" />Mia mofikiriakana kapeeluana karona sumai apomusu tee Aulataʼala roonamo incia inda ataʼati hukumuna Aulataʼala tee incia dhaanamo inda amembali ataʼati hukumuna Aulataʼala. <verse eid="ROM 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 8:8" />Jadi, manga mia modhadhina moosena kapeeluana karona atantumo inda amembali apasanaa Aulataʼala.<verse eid="ROM 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 8:9" />Maka moomini mboo sumai, ingkomiu inda udhadhi uose kapeeluana karomiu, maka udhadhi uose kapeeluana Rohi, ande atotuu-totuu o Rohi sumai amboore i nuncana karomiu. Roonamo ande dhaangia o mia inda modhadhiakana tee Rohina Isa Al Masi, incia mencuana pewauana Al Masi. <verse eid="ROM 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 8:10" />Maka ande o Al Masi adhaangia i nuncana karomiu, moomini o badamiu bheamate rampaakanamo dosa, sumaimo Rohina Aulataʼala bheapadhadhikomiu rampaakanamo kabanara. <verse eid="ROM 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 8:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 3:16">1Kor. 3:16</ref>.</char></note>Aulataʼala padhamo apadhadhi Isa pendua minaaka i tanga-tangana mia mate, tee ande o Rohina adhaangia i nuncana karomiu, sumaimo Aulataʼala mopadhana mopadhadhina Al Masi minaaka i mate sumai uka bheapadhadhi badamiu mofanaana tee Rohina modhaangiana i nuncana karomiu.<verse eid="ROM 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 8:12" />E manga witinaiku, jadi sii-sii ingkita tawaajibu tadhadhi taose kapeeluana Rohina Aulataʼala. Bholimo uka taose kapeeluata karota! <verse eid="ROM 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 8:13" />Roonamo ande uose kapeeluana karomiu, sumaimo bheumate, maka ande tee kuasana Rohi ingkomiu indamo uka upewau manga giu mokodosa, sumaimo ingkomiu bheudhadhi!<verse eid="ROM 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 8:14" />Jadi bhari-bharia mia ikapalaina Rohina Aulataʼala satotuuna manga anana Aulataʼala. <verse eid="ROM 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 8:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 14:36">Mrk. 14:36</ref>.</char></note><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:15-17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 4:5-7">Gal. 4:5-7</ref>.</char></note>Rohi itarimamiu minaaka i Aulataʼala inda apamembalikomiu bhatua, sabutuna bheudhadhi i nuncana kaeka pendua. Maka o Rohina Aulataʼala mopadhana itarimamiu mopamembalikomiu anana Aulataʼala. Tee o Rohina Aulataʼala sumai imembaliakata tagora, "E Abba,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:15 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Abba: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">I nuncana pogau Aram, maʼanana o 'Ama.'</char></note> e Ama." <verse eid="ROM 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 8:16" />Rohina Aulataʼala apobhawa-bhawa tee rohita to adhawuaka kasakusiina, ande ingkita sii manga anana Aulataʼala. <verse eid="ROM 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 8:17" />Ande ingkita manga anana Aulataʼala, maʼanana ingkita bhetamembali manga mia mokotinaurakaakana bhari-bharia giu mopadhana ipasiapuakana Aulataʼala. Opea mopadhana ipasadiaakana Aulataʼala to Al Masi sumai bhetatarimaia tapobhawa tee Incia, roonamo ande ingkita tanarakaa tapoose tee Al Masi, ingkita bhetatomuliangi tapobhawa-bhawa tee Incia.<verse eid="ROM 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ingkita Bhetatarima Kamuliangina Aulataʼala tee Al Masi</para>
  <para style="sr">
    <ref loc="ROM 8:18-30">8:18-30</ref>
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 8:18" />Rampaakanamo sumai, iaku kuabhia ande o kanarakaa inamisita i zamani sii-sii inda amembali topapodhimbaia tee kamuliangi bheidhawuakana to ingkita naile itu. <verse eid="ROM 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 8:19" />Roonamo bhari-bharia giu ipadhaangia apemeliliaka mpuu naepia o wakutuuna Aulataʼala to apatiumbaaka manga anana. <verse eid="ROM 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 8:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 3:17-19">Bhaa. 3:17-19</ref>.</char></note>Kaapaaka bhari-bharia giu ipadhaangia padhamo ajolia sabutuna indamo tee gunana, tee o giu incia sumai mencuana kapeeluna manga incia, maka o kapeeluna Aulataʼala. Moomini mboo sumai, dhaangia tee kaharapu, <verse eid="ROM 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 8:21" />ande o giu ipadhaangia sii bheatopabebasi minaaka i kapabhatua mopahancurua, tee atomuliangi apobhawa-bhawa tee manga anana Aulataʼala.<verse eid="ROM 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 8:22" />Roonamo tamataua, ande sakawana sii-sii, bhari-bharia giu ipadhaangia aposapeenci roonamo kanarakaa inamisina manga incia mboomo kapiina bhawine mokoana. <verse eid="ROM 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 8:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 5:2-4">2Kor. 5:2-4</ref>.</char></note>Mencuana soo manga incia mopeencina, maka ingkita uka tapeenci i nuncana ngangarandata. Ingkita padhamo tatarima Rohina Aulataʼala momembalina kadhawuna Aulataʼala mobhaa-bhaana, tee sii-sii ingkita dhaangiapo uka taantagi Aulataʼala to mangaangkana tamembaliaka anana, siitumo to katolosina badata. <verse eid="ROM 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 8:24" />I nuncanamo kaharapu incia sii ingkita tatopasalaamati. Maka ande opea iharaputa sumai atokamatamo, mencuanamo kaharapu o sarona. Roonamo inda dhaangia mia moharapuna giu mopadhana ikamatana! <verse eid="ROM 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 8:25" />Maka ande ingkita taharapuaka giu indapo ikamatata, ingkita taantagia tee kasabara.<verse eid="ROM 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 8:26" />Mboomo sumai uka o Rohina Aulataʼala mangatulungi i nuncana kakurangata. Roonamo opea mofaraluuna idoʼaakata inda tamataua, maka o Rohina Aulataʼala sumai mangadoʼaaka tee kapeencina ngangarandana inda momembalina ibhoasaka tee pogau. <verse eid="ROM 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 8:27" />Aulataʼala momatauna antona ngangarandana maanusia sumai, amataua uka o kapeeluana Rohi, roonamo Rohi sumai adoʼaaka manga mia mosaalihi apokana mboomo kapeeluana Aulataʼala. <verse eid="ROM 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 8:28" />Ingkita uka tamataua ande o Aulataʼala moʼatorona bhari-bharia giu mamudhaakana aumbaaka kalape to manga mia momaasiakea, siitumo manga incia ikembana. Manga incia atokemba mboomo ihaejatiakana Aulataʼala. <verse eid="ROM 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 8:29" />Roonamo ingkita imatauna Aulataʼala pepuu minaaka i auwalina, tee ingkita uka mopadhana ipatotapuakana minaaka i auwalina to tapokanaaka tee Anana, mamudhaakana o Isa Al Masi amembali Ana tumpe minaaka i kabharina witinaina. <verse eid="ROM 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 8:30" />Manga incia mopadhana ipatotapuakana Aulataʼala minaaka i auwalina sumai akembaia Aulataʼala; sapadhana akembaia, manga incia aabhimea abanara i aroana Aulataʼala; sapadhana atoabhi abanara, manga incia amuliangimea uka.<verse eid="ROM 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kaasina Aulataʼala to Ingkita Alaloi Isa Al Masi</para>
  <para style="sr">
    <ref loc="ROM 8:31-39">8:31-39</ref>
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 8:31" />Jadi opea bhemomembalina ipogauakata to bhari-bharia giu incia sumai? Ande o Aulataʼala mangaewaaka, inda bheadhaangia o musu momembalina mangapekatalona! <verse eid="ROM 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 8:32" />Aulataʼala ataroaka Anana karona anarakaa tee akurubaniakea to mangapasalaamatiaka. Aulataʼala padhamo adhawuaka Anana, jadi Incia uka dhaanamo bheamangadhawuaka bhari-bharia giu. <verse eid="ROM 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 8:33" />Incema buaka momembalina moraeakana manga mia ipilina Aulataʼala sumai? Garaaka o Aulataʼala karona mangaabhina tabanara. <verse eid="ROM 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ROM 8:34" />Incema bhemomangahukumuna? Inda dhaangia! Roonamo Isa Al Masi padhamo mangamateaka, tee Incia uka adhadhimo pendua minaaka i mate, tee sii-sii auncuramo i weta kaanana Aulataʼala tee amembalimo Potoloweata to momangadoʼaakana. <verse eid="ROM 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ROM 8:35" />Incema buaka momembalina mangapapogaana minaaka i kaasina Al Masi? Inda dhaangia! Amembali buaka o kapisaki, kanarakaa, kasikisaa, kaara, kalealea, balaa, atawa o hancu mangapapogaa minaaka i kaasina? Inda! <verse eid="ROM 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ROM 8:36" />Roonamo mboomo mopadhana motoburina i nuncana Kitabi Momangkilo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 8:36">"Rampaakanamo Ingkoo, saeoa ingkami tadhadhi i nuncana balaa imateaka.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 8:36">Ingkami tatoabhi mboomo manga dumba bheisumbele."<verse eid="ROM 8:36" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ROM 8:37" />Maka i nuncana bhari-bharia kajadia incia sumai, Aulataʼala mangapakana totuu-totuu alaloi Isa Al Masi momangamaasiakana. <verse eid="ROM 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ROM 8:38" />Roonamo iaku kuyaakini, malape o mate atawa o dhadhi, malape manga malaaʼekati atawa manga pamarinta, malape manga giu modhaangiana sii-sii atawa bhemoumbana naile itu, pegiu-giuna kuasa, <verse eid="ROM 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ROM 8:39" />tampa momalanga, tampa momandala, atawa opeapo uka bhari-bharia giu ipadhaangia, bhari-bharia sumai inda dhaangia momembalina mangapapogaana minaaka i kaasina Aulataʼala alaloi Isa Al Masi Oputa Momalanga.<verse eid="ROM 8:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ROM 9" />
  <para style="s1">Uumati Ipilina Aulataʼala</para>
  <para style="sr">
    <ref loc="ROM 9:1-29">9:1-29</ref>
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 9:1" />Iaku kupogauaka kabanara roonamo kuposaangu tee Isa Al Masi tee iaku inda kugau-gau, sampe o ngangarandaku ikuasaina Rohina Aulataʼala sii amembali sakusiiku <verse eid="ROM 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 9:2" />ande incaku amaasi, tee o ngangarandaku inda aunto-unto amaporo. <verse eid="ROM 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 9:3" />Iaku uka kurela ande atundaaku Aulataʼala tee kupogaa tee Isa Al Masi, ande o giu incia sumai to kutulungiaka manga witinaiku mosalipuna tee iaku. <verse eid="ROM 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 9:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 4:22">Limb. 4:22</ref>.</char></note>Manga incia sii satotuuna o miana Israel, tee manga incia aangkea amembali anana Aulataʼala tee padhamo atarima kamuliangi, atarima manga pojanjia, atarima Hukumuna Taurati, atarima tuturana ibaadati, tee atarima sagala giuna janjina Aulataʼala. <verse eid="ROM 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 9:5" />Manga incia satotuuna o siwuluna opu-opuata ipilina Aulataʼala, tee aminaaka i tanga-tangana manga incia o Isa Al Masi alaahiri amembali maanusia. Incia atopekalanga minaaka i bhari-bharia giu, tee Incia o Aulataʼala molaengana ipuji saʼumurua. Aamin!<verse eid="ROM 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 9:6" />Moomini mboo sumai, iaku inda kupogauaka ande o firimanina Aulataʼala indamo atopake. Roonamo inda bhari-bharia mia mominaakana i lipuna Israel o miana Israel, <verse eid="ROM 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 9:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 21:12">Bhaa. 21:12</ref>.</char></note>tee inda bhari-bharia anana Nabii Ibrahim atosarongi uka siwuluna Nabii Ibrahim mototuu-totuuna, maka mboomo mopadhana motoburi, "Tangkanamo siwuluna Ishak bhemotosarongina siwulumu." <verse eid="ROM 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 9:8" />Maʼanana, inda bhari-bharia mia mominaakana i siwuluna Nabii Ibrahim amembali atosarongi anana Aulataʼala, maka tangkanamo siwulu mominaakana i pojanjiana Aulataʼalamea motosarongina siwuluna Nabii Ibrahim. <verse eid="ROM 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 9:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 18:10">Bhaa. 18:10</ref>.</char></note>Roonamo janjina Aulataʼala mboo sii, "I tao i aroa i bula mopokana tee bula incia sii, Iaku bhekuumba pendua, tee o Sarah bheapalaahirimo samia ana umane."<verse eid="ROM 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 9:10" />Mencuana soo incia sumai, maka o Ribka uka apalaahiri rua mia ana umane minaaka i samia ama, siitumo Nabii Ishak opu-opuata. <verse eid="ROM 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 9:11" />Maka wakutuuna rua miaia anaana sumai indapo alaahiri, Aulataʼala padhamo apatotapuaka bheipilina sapadhana sumai. Opea ipilina Aulataʼala sumai inda aose opea momembalina ipewauna maanusia, maka aose kakembana Aulataʼala. Roonamo wakutuuna rua miaia anana Ribka sumai indapo amembali apewau giu malape atawa o giu madhaki, <verse eid="ROM 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 9:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 25:23">Bhaa. 25:23</ref>.</char></note>Aulataʼala padhamo apogau tee Ribka, "Ana tumpemu bheamembali bhatuana andina." <verse eid="ROM 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 9:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAL 1:2-3">Mal. 1:2-3</ref>.</char></note>I nuncana Kitabi Momangkilo atoburi ande o Aulataʼala apogau mboo sii, "Yakub kumaasiakea, maka o Esau kubancia."<verse eid="ROM 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 9:14" />Ande mboo sumai, opea bheipogauakata? Buaka o Aulataʼala inda aʼadili? Inda, Aulataʼala sumai aʼadili mpuu! <verse eid="ROM 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 9:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 33:19">Limb. 33:19</ref>.</char></note>Roonamo Aulataʼala apogau tee Nabii Musa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:15">"Iaku bhekudhawuaka kaasiku to mia imaasiakaku,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:15">tee Iaku bhekupekalulu incaku to incema bheipekaluluakana incaku."<verse eid="ROM 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 9:16" />Jadi o giu incia sumai mencuana rampaakanamo kapeeluana maanusia atawa o usahana maanusia, maka aminaaka i kaasina Aulataʼala. <verse eid="ROM 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 9:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 9:16">Limb. 9:16</ref>.</char></note>Roonamo i nuncana Kitabi Momangkilo Aulataʼala apogau tee Firaun, "Iaku kuangkako umembali samia raja mamudhaakana ususuaka kuasaku tee upakoleleaka saroku i saangua dunia." <verse eid="ROM 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 9:18" />Jadi o Aulataʼala adhika kaasina incana to incemapo uka ipilina, tee apekakaa incana to mia ipilina.<verse eid="ROM 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 9:19" />Sii-sii ingkomiu koroo bheupogau tee iaku, "Ande mboo itu, apokia o Aulataʼala dhaangiapo uka apasala maanusia? Incema buaka momembalina mobhalina kapeeluana Aulataʼala?" <verse eid="ROM 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 9:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 29:16">Yes. 29:16</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 45:9">45:9</ref>.</char></note>E maanusia, incema buaka ingkomiu mbakana ubarani utagali Aulataʼala? Amembali buaka o giu motokarajaa aabha i mia mokarajaaia, "Apokia ukarajaaku mboo sii?" <verse eid="ROM 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 9:21" />Buaka o pande poluka inda tee hakuna tee tana reona? Atantumo dhaangia, pande poluka akohaku akarajaa opeapo uka ipeeluna. Roonamo minaaka i satongka tana mopokana incia amembali akarajaa saangu bara momulia, tee amembali uka akarajaa bara inda momulia. <verse eid="ROM 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 9:22" />Mboomo uka tee Aulataʼala. Incia tee kuasana to akarajaa opeapo uka ipeeluna tee ingkita maanusia. Incia tee hakuna to ahukumu mia madhaki tee apatokamata kuasana. Maka Incia asabara tee manga mia mopewauna giu ipamuruakana tee molaengana motohukumuna saʼumurua. <verse eid="ROM 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 9:23" />Tee cara incia sumai, Incia asusuaka kabharina kamuliangina to manga bara imaasiakana tee mopadhana ipasiapuakana to motarimana kaasina, siitumo ingkita. <verse eid="ROM 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 9:24" />Ingkitamo o manga mia mopadhana ikembana, tee mencuana soo miana Yahudi, maka o mia inda motolentuna miana Yahudi uka. <verse eid="ROM 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 9:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 2:22">Hos. 2:22</ref>.</char></note>Giu incia sumai apokana tee firimanina Aulataʼala mopadhana ipakawaakana alaloi Nabii Hosea,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:25">"Manga mia inda motolentuna uumatiku bhekusarongia 'uumatiku,'</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:25">tee manga mia inda imaasiakaku bhekusarongia 'mia imaasiakaku.'<verse eid="ROM 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 9:26" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:26 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HOS 1:10">Hos. 1:10</ref>.</char>
    </note>Tee i tampa mopadhana ipogauakaku to manga incia mboo sii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:26">'Ingkomiu sii mencuana uumatiku,'</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:26">iwe sumai manga incia bheatosarongi, 'Manga anana Aulataʼala modhadhi.' "<verse eid="ROM 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 9:27" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:27-28 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 10:22-23">Yes. 10:22-23</ref>. </char>
    </note>Nabii Yesaya uka apogau mboo sumai to miana Israel,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:27">"Moomini o kabharina siwuluna Israel mboo kabharina bhone i tawo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:27">maka tangkanamo saidhemea bhemosalaamatina.<verse eid="ROM 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 9:28" />Roonamo opea ifirimaniakana bheasangka tee amadhei</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:28">apewaua Kawasana Opu i bhawona alamu sii."<verse eid="ROM 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 9:29" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:29 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 1:9">Yes. 1:9</ref>.</char>
    </note>Tee mboomo mopadhana ipogauakana Yesaya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:29">"Ande o Kawasana Opu Mokuasaina alamu inda mangabholiaka siwulu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:29">sumaimo ingkita tatopabinasa mboomo Kota Sodom tee Kota Gomora."<verse eid="ROM 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Manga Miana Yahudi Aose Dhala Mosala to Apotibhaaka Kabanara</para>
  <para style="sr">
    <ref loc="ROM 9:30-10:3">9:30--10:3</ref>
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 9:30" />Ande mboo sumai, opea momembalina ipogauakata? Manga mia inda motolentuna miana Yahudi inda mopeelona kabanara, apotibhaakamo kabanara, siitumo kabanara mominaakana i iimani. <verse eid="ROM 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 9:31" />Maka o miana Yahudi mompuu-mpuuna incana mopeelona kabanarana Hukumuna Taurati inda amembali aose o hukumu incia sumai. <verse eid="ROM 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 9:32" />Apokia manga incia inda amembali aose o hukumu incia sumai? Roonamo manga incia inda aosea tee iimani, maka manga incia aosea tee pewauna karona. Manga incia atosunu i bhatu itosunuaka,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:32 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">bhatu itosunuaka: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Siitumo Isa, roonamo dhaangia o mia inda moparacaeana tee momandawuna, maka dhaangia uka o mia moparacaeana tee o dhalana indamo tee mojolia. </char></note> <verse eid="ROM 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 9:33" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 28:16">Yes. 28:16</ref>.</char></note>mboomo mopadhana motoburina i nuncana Kitabi Momangkilo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:33">"Kamatamea, Iaku padhamo kudhika saangu bhatu itosunuakana mia i Gunu Sion,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:33">siitumo saangu bhatu maoge imanduliakana mia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:33">tee o mia moparacaeana tee Incia inda bheatopekaea."<verse eid="ROM 9:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ROM 10" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 10:1" />E manga witinaiku, kapeeluana ngangarandaku tee o doʼaku i Aulataʼala to miana Yahudi satotuuna mamudhaakana manga incia amembali atopasalaamati. <verse eid="ROM 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 10:2" />Tee iaku kubarani kudhawuaka kasakusiiku to manga incia, ande manga incia ampuu-mpuu aʼusaha to alaiani Aulataʼala, maka o usahana sumai inda apewaua tee fahamu mobanara. <verse eid="ROM 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 10:3" />Manga incia inda amataua o kabanarana Aulataʼala tee rampaakanamo manga incia aʼusaha to aose kabanarana karona, mbakanamo manga incia inda atungku tee kabanarana Aulataʼala.<verse eid="ROM 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tatopabanara Rampaakanamo Kaparacaeata</para>
  <para style="sr">
    <ref loc="ROM 10:4-15">10:4-15</ref>
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 10:4" />Sainamo tujuana kapadhaana Hukumuna Taurati sumai satotuuna o Al Masi, sabutuna o kabanara apotibhaakea bhari-bharia mia moparacaeaia. <verse eid="ROM 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 10:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 18:5">Im. 18:5</ref>.</char></note>Roonamo Nabii Musa aburi pokaiana tee mia motopabanarana molaloina kataʼatina tee tuturana Hukumuna Taurati, siitumo, "Mia motoabhina mobanara i aroana Aulataʼala tabeana adhadhi aose bhari-bharia tuturana Hukumuna Taurati sumai." <verse eid="ROM 10:5" /><verse number="6-7" style="v" sid="ROM 10:6-7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:6-8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 30:12-14">Kap. 30:12-14</ref>.</char></note>Maka satotuuna o maanusia amembali atopabanara i aroana Aulataʼala tangkanamo tee kaparacaeana mpuu tee Al Masi. Giu incia sumai apokana tee parintana Aulataʼala modhaangiana i nuncana Kitabi Momangkilo motoburina mboo sii, "Bholi upogau i nuncana ngangarandamu, 'Ingkomiu inda ufaraluu upene sakawana i bhawona laiana atawa usapo i tambena alamu.' " Roonamo parinta incia sumai apogauaka pokaiana tee Al Masi. Maʼanana, "Ingkomiu inda afaraluu upeelo dhala sakawana i sorogaa to amembaliaka upasapo Al Masi i dunia mamudhaakana atulungikomiu. Tee ingkomiu uka inda afaraluu usapo i bhalona alamuna mia mate to upapeneaka Al Masi iwe sii. Roonamo Al Masi amakasumo tee ingkita."<verse eid="ROM 10:6-7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 10:8" />Jadi, dhalana kasalaamati ipakoleleakamami sii inda amarasai: Soo uparacaeamo! Cara incia sii uka apokana tee firimani modhaangiana i nuncana Kitabi Momangkilo motoburina mboo sii, "Dhalana kasalaamati mobanara mominaakana i Aulataʼala amakasumo tee ingkomiu, siitumo i nuncana ngangamiu tee i nuncana ngangarandamiu." <verse eid="ROM 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 10:9" />Roonamo ande uʼakuia tee ngangamiu ande o Isa Al Masi sumai satotuuna o Kawasana Opu, tee uparacaeaia i nuncana ngangarandamiu ande o Aulataʼala padhamo apadhadhi pendua Al Masi minaaka i mate, tee mboo sumai ingkomiu bheutopasalaamati. <verse eid="ROM 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 10:10" />Roonamo wakutuuna o giu incia sumai taparacaeaia i nuncana ngangarandata, ingkita tatopabanara i aroana Aulataʼala. Tee wakutuuna tatotuu-totuu tamangaku tamembali mia moosena Al Masi, ingkita bhetatopasalaamati. <verse eid="ROM 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 10:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 28:16">Yes. 28:16</ref>.</char></note>Tee i nuncana Kitabi Momangkilo atoburi mboo sii, "Incema-incema moparacaeana tee Incia, inda bheatopekaea." <verse eid="ROM 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 10:12" />Firimani incia sumai to bhari-bharia maanusia, malape miana Yahudi atawa o mia inda motolentuna miana Yahudi. Roonamo tangkanamo sakaro-karona o Aulataʼala momembalina Kawasana Opuna bhari-bharia mia tee ataralabhi-labhi mpuu adhawuaka kabarakatina to manga mia moemanina katulungina. <verse eid="ROM 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 10:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOL 2:32">Yol. 2:32</ref>. </char></note>"Rampaakanamo sumai, bhari-bharia mia moemanina katulungi i Kawasana Opu bheatopasalaamati."<verse eid="ROM 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 10:14" />Maka tuaapa manga incia amembali aemani tulungi i Kawasana Opu ande manga incia inda aparacaeaia? Tuaapa manga incia aparacaeaia ande manga incia indapo arango lelena? Tuaapa manga incia arango lelena ande inda dhaangia manga mia mopakoleleakea? <verse eid="ROM 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 10:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 52:7">Yes. 52:7</ref>.</char></note>Tuaapa amembali manga mia apakoleleaka lelena ande inda atolamboko? Mboomo mopadhana motoburina i nuncana Kitabi Momangkilo, "Amakesa mpuu o umbaana manga mia mobhawana lele malape minaaka i Aulataʼala!"<verse eid="ROM 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abhari o Miana Yahudi Inda Moparacaeana tee Kitabi Momangkilo</para>
  <para style="sr">
    <ref loc="ROM 10:16-21">10:16-21</ref>
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 10:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:16 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 53:1">Yes. 53:1</ref>.</char>
    </note>Moomini mboo sumai, inda bhari-bharia mia aparacaea tee Lele Malape sumai, mboomo ipogauakana Nabii Yesaya, "E Kawasana Opu, incema moparacaeana tee lele ipakoleleakamami?" <verse eid="ROM 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 10:17" />Jadi o kaparacaeana manga mia aumba minaaka i porangona, tee opea irangona aumba alaloi mia mopakoleleakana lelena Al Masi. <verse eid="ROM 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 10:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 19:5">Zab. 19:5</ref>.</char></note>Maka iaku kuabha, "Buaka manga incia indapo arangoa o lele incia sumai?" Atantumo manga incia arangoa! Roonamo i nuncana Kitabi Momangkilo atoburi mboo sii,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:18">"Suarana manga incia atorangomo i saangua dunia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 10:18">tee o pogauna manga incia akawamo i tapana alamu."<verse eid="ROM 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 10:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:19 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 32:21">Kap. 32:21</ref>.</char>
    </note>Iaku kuabha pendua, "Buaka o miana Israel indapo amaʼanaia o Lele Malape sumai? Bhaa-bhaana tabeana tamataua ande o Aulataʼala padhamo apogauakea tee Nabii Musa mboo sii,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:19">"Iaku bhekupamembali ngangarandamiu akaura-ura tee manga mia inda motosarongina 'uumatiku,'</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 10:19">tee Iaku bhekupamembalikomiu uʼamara tee lipu mokabhongo-bhongo."<verse eid="ROM 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 10:20" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:20-21 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 65:1-2">Yes. 65:1-2</ref>.</char>
    </note>Mencuana soo incia sumai, maka tee kabaranina uka o Nabii Yesaya apakawaaka firimanina Aulataʼala tee apogau mboo sii,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:20">"Iaku apotibhaakaaku manga mia inda mopeeloaku,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 10:20">Iaku uka kuunda kupatomatauaka karoku to manga mia inda moabhaakaaku."<verse eid="ROM 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 10:21" />Maka to miana Israel, siimo firimanina Aulataʼala ipakawaakana Nabii Yesaya, "Saeoa kupaulu limaku to lipu modorohaka tee lipu momentagali."<verse eid="ROM 10:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ROM 11" />
  <para style="s1">Aulataʼala Inda Amalinguaka Uumatina</para>
  <para style="sr">
    <ref loc="ROM 11:1-10">11:1-10</ref>
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 11:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PHP 3:5">Flp. 3:5</ref>.</char>
    </note>Kasiimpo iaku kuabha, "Buaka o Aulataʼala amendeu uumatina? Atantumo inda! Roonamo iaku uka o miana Israel, siwuluna Nabii Ibrahim minaaka i suku Binyamin. <verse eid="ROM 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 11:2" />Aulataʼala inda amendeu uumatina mopadhana ipilina pepuu minaaka i auwalina. Buaka inda umataua opea motoburina i nuncana Kitabi Momangkilo pokaiana tee Nabii Ilyas, wakutuuna incia apetutuaka kadhakina miana Israel i Aulataʼala? <verse eid="ROM 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 11:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 19:10">1Raj. 19:10</ref>.</char></note>Nabii Ilyas apogau, "E Kawasana Opu, manga incia padhamo apekamate manga nabiimu tee padhamo apahancuru manga tampana pasombaana kurubanimu. Soomo samia-miaku modhadhina tee manga incia gauna apekamateaku." <verse eid="ROM 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 11:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 19:18">1Raj. 19:18</ref>.</char></note>Maka tuaapa o kalawanina Aulataʼala tee Nabii Ilyas? "Inda! Iaku padhamo kupili tee kujagani pitu rewu mia to karoku manga mia indapo mopernana mosombana dewa Baal." <verse eid="ROM 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 11:5" />Mboomo uka sii-sii, dhaangia sagaa o mia mopadhana ipilina Aulataʼala to amembali uumatina rampaakanamo rahumatina. <verse eid="ROM 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 11:6" />Roonamo ande manga incia apilia Aulataʼala rampaakanamo rahumatina, giu ipilina sumai mencuana rampaakanamo kalapena pewauna, roonamo ande rampaakanamo pewauna, sumaimo rahumatina Aulataʼala mencuanamo uka rahumati mototuu-totuuna. <verse eid="ROM 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 11:7" />Jadi atindamo ande o miana Israel inda apotibhaaka opea ipeelona, maka o miana Israel mopadhana ipilina Aulataʼala apotibhaaka opea ipeelona, sainamo miana Israel mosagaanana atopekakaa incana, <verse eid="ROM 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 11:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 29:4">Kap. 29:4</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 29:10">Yes. 29:10</ref>.</char></note>mboomo mopadhana motoburina i nuncana Kitabi Momangkilo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:8">"Aulataʼala apekakundu ngangarandana tee fikirina manga incia,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:8">matana manga incia inda apokamata</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:8">tee o talingana inda aporango</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:8">sakawana sii-sii."<verse eid="ROM 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 11:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:9-10 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 69:23-24">Zab. 69:23-24</ref>.</char>
    </note>Raja Daud uka apogau,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:9">"Taroakamo kinande i aroana manga incia amembali katapu tee kadhoa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:9">tee amembali bhatu itosunuaka<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:9 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">bhatu itosunuaka: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Maʼanana o giu ikuraakana iimanina mia atawa o giu imandawuakana mia i nuncana dosa. </char></note> tee kabalasi to manga incia.<verse eid="ROM 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 11:10" />Taroakamo matana manga incia amarawu mamudhaakana inda amembali apokamata,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:10">tee taroakamo o tangana manga incia atorotorosu abungku."<verse eid="ROM 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kasalaamatina Manga Mia Inda Motolentuna Miana Yahudi</para>
  <para style="sr">
    <ref loc="ROM 11:11-24">11:11-24</ref>
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 11:11" />Sumaimo iaku kuabha, "Buaka o giu itosunuakana manga miana Yahudi sumai imembaliakana manga incia ahancuru saʼumurua?" Atantumo inda! Maka rampaakanamo kasalahana manga incia o kasalaamati akawamo i manga mia inda motolentuna miana Yahudi mamudhaakana o miana Yahudi agigibulu. <verse eid="ROM 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 11:12" />Ande o kasalahana manga incia imembaliakana saangua dunia arangkaea tee opea inda ikohasiliakana manga incia imembaliakana mia inda motolentuna miana Yahudi arangkaea, ntaranamo uka ande o miana Yahudi apomalape pendua tee Aulataʼala!<verse eid="ROM 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 11:13" />E manga mia inda motolentuna miana Yahudi! Iaku kupogau tee ingkomiu, roonamo iaku alambokoaku kumembaliaka rasulu to manga mia inda motolentuna miana Yahudi tee o tugasiku sii kuabhia saangu giu momulia. <verse eid="ROM 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 11:14" />Iaku kuharapu mamudhaakana amembali kupagigibulu miana lipuku karoku tee iaku kumembali kupasalaamati sagaa minaaka i manga incia. <verse eid="ROM 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 11:15" />Roonamo wakutuuna Aulataʼala amendeumo atarima miana Yahudi to amembali uumatina, sumaimo Incia apamembali manga mia inda motolentuna miana Yahudi apomalape pendua tee Karona, ntaranamo uka ande Incia atarima manga miana Yahudi! Atantumo giu incia sumai apokana mboomo mia momate modhadhina pendua. <verse eid="ROM 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 11:16" />Ande o kakumbuna roti mobhaa-bhaana<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:16 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">kakumbuna roti mobhaa-bhaana: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aipomo ibarati incia sii apatujuakea to manga miana Yahudi mobhaa-bhaana moparacaeana tee Isa. </char></note> ipasombaaka to Aulataʼala sumai amangkilo, sumaimo bhari-bharia kajalona roti<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:16 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">bhari-bharia kajalona roti: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aipomo ibarati incia sii, apatujuaka to manga miana Israel momembalina uumatina tee inda ibholina Aulataʼala, moomini saidhemea moparacaeana tee Al Masi wakutuuna atolamboko. </char></note> bheamangkilo uka; ande o kulesena<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:16 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">kulesena: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aipomo ibarati incia sii, opu-opuana miana Israel siitumo Nabii Ibrahim, Ishak tee Yakub. </char></note> saangu puuna zaitun amangkilo, sumaimo manga rahana<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:16 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">manga rahana: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aipomo ibarati incia sii asusuaka o siwuluna Nabii Ibrahim siitumo manga miana Israel.</char></note> bheamangkilo uka. <verse eid="ROM 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 11:17" />Maka ande dhaangia pia raha motokatukina<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:17 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">raha motokatukina: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Maʼanana ibarati incia sii o miana Yahudi inda moparacaeana tee Isa Al Masi, sabutuna manga incia indamo aposaangu tee uumatina Aulataʼala. </char></note> minaaka i puuna zaitun sumai, tee ingkomiu o mia inda motolentuna miana Yahudi umembali mboomo tunana puuna kau motuwuakana karona i sambalina inawu, tee apamembalikomiu raha motocangko<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:17 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">raha motocangko: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Maʼanana ibarati incia sii, manga mia inda motolentuna miana Yahudi motopaposaanguna tee uumatina Aulataʼala roonamo aparacaea tee Isa Al Masi. </char></note> to mobholosiakana raha ikatuki minaaka i puuna zaitun motopombulana i saao, sumaimo ingkomiu bheupokawaaka sagaa uka minaaka i kulesena puuna zaitun mosuburu sumai. <verse eid="ROM 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 11:18" />Rampaakanamo sumai bholi ubangga tee upandaʼente manga raha motokana, siitumo manga miana Yahudi. Maka ande upandaʼentea, ingkomiu tabeana uudhania ande mencuana ingkomiu motukona kulese sumai, maka o kulese motukokomiu. <verse eid="ROM 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 11:19" />Aipo ingkomiu bheupogau, "Manga raha sumai atokatuki mamudhaakana ingkami tatocangko i tampana manga incia." <verse eid="ROM 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 11:20" />Umbe! Satotuuna manga incia atokatuki roonamo inda aparacaea, tee ingkomiu umatangka iwe sumai roonamo iimani! Rampaakanamo sumai, bholi usombo, maka umaekamo. <verse eid="ROM 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 11:21" />Roonamo ande o Aulataʼala inda ameri to akatuki manga raha motokana, sumaimo ingkomiu uka amembali utokatuki ande indamo uparacaea. <verse eid="ROM 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 11:22" />Rampaakanamo sumai, kamatamea o kalapena incana tee kakaana Aulataʼala. Incia amakaa tee manga mia mokodosa, maka amalape incana tee ingkomiu, somanamo ingkomiu usadhaadhaa upengkeni tee kalapena incana, roonamo ande inda mboo sumai, ingkomiu uka bheutokatuki. <verse eid="ROM 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 11:23" />Maka to miana Israel, ande manga incia indamo amentagali tee aparacaeamo tee lelena kasalaamati mominaakana i Aulataʼala, sumaimo manga incia uka bheatotarima pendua, roonamo Aulataʼala akokuasa to atarimaia pendua. <verse eid="ROM 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 11:24" />Sainamo ingkomiu mopadhana motokatukina minaaka i puuna zaitun motuwuakana karona i sambalina inawu tee mopadhana motocangkona i puuna zaitun moʼasiliina sumai amembalimo atocangko, ntaranamo uka manga rahana puuna zaitun mototuu-totuuna sumai! Atantumo manga incia amembali atocangko pendua i puuna asalana.<verse eid="ROM 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kaasina Aulataʼala to Bhari-bharia Uumatina</para>
  <para style="sr">
    <ref loc="ROM 11:25-36">11:25-36</ref>
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 11:25" />E manga witinaiku inda motolentuna miana Yahudi, iaku bhekupaumbaakakomiu rahasia incia sii mamudhaakana inda uabhi karomiu o mia momalapena budina: Sagaa minaaka i miana Yahudi amentagali, maka o giu incia sii tangkanamo bheamembali sakawana manga mia inda motolentuna miana Yahudi aparacaea tee Aulataʼala. <verse eid="ROM 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 11:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 59:20">Yes. 59:20</ref>.</char></note>Tee mboo sumai bhari-bharia miana Yahudi bheatopasalaamati, mboomo mopadhana motoburina i nuncana Kitabi Momangkilo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:26">"Rajana Kasalaamati bheaumba minaaka i Kota Sion;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:26">Incia mohapusuna bhari-bharia kadhaki minaaka i siwuluna Yakub.<verse eid="ROM 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 11:27" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:27 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 31:33-34">Yer. 31:33-34</ref>.</char>
    </note>Iaku bhekubhoke pojanjia tee manga incia</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:27">wakutuuna kuhapusu dosana manga incia."<verse eid="ROM 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 11:28" />Roonamo miana Yahudi amendeu atarima Lele Malape minaaka i Aulataʼala, sumaimo manga incia amembalimo musuna Aulataʼala; tee giu incia sumai amembalimo saangu kalape to manga mia inda motolentuna miana Yahudi. Maka rampaakanamo miana Yahudi mopadhana ipilina Aulataʼala, sabutuna manga incia asadhaadhaa amaasiakea Aulataʼala rampaakanamo opu-opuana manga incia. <verse eid="ROM 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 11:29" />Roonamo ande o Aulataʼala padhamo apili tee arahumati mia mopadhana ipilina, sumaimo Incia inda bheaalea pendua opea mopadhana idhawuakana sumai. <verse eid="ROM 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 11:30" />Apokana tee ingkomiu: I piamo itu udorohaka tee Aulataʼala, maka sii-sii ingkomiu o manga mia inda motolentuna miana Yahudi upotibhaakamo kaasina Aulataʼala rampaakanamo kadorohakana manga miana Israel. <verse eid="ROM 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 11:31" />Mboo sumai uka tee manga miana Israel: Sii-sii manga incia adorohaka tee Aulataʼala, mamudhaakana ingkomiu utopabebasi minaaka i kasalahamiu. Maka naile itu manga incia uka bheapotibhaaka kaasi rampaakanamo kaasi mopadhana ipotibhaakamiu. <verse eid="ROM 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 11:32" />Roonamo Aulataʼala padhamo ataroaka bhari-bharia mia to apewau dosa mamudhaakana Incia asusuaka kaasina to manga incia bhari-bharia.<verse eid="ROM 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 11:33" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:33 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 55:8">Yes. 55:8</ref>.</char>
    </note>Amaoge mpuu o rahumatina, hikimatina, tee katauna Aulataʼala to bhari-bharia mia! Inda dhaangia momembalina momatauna manga kambotuna tee inda dhaangia uka momatauna tuaapa o carana Incia aʼatoro bhari-bharia giu.<verse eid="ROM 11:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ROM 11:34" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:34 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 40:13">Yes. 40:13</ref>.</char>
    </note>"Incema buaka o mia momembalina momatauna fikirina Kawasana Opu?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:34">Tee incema o mia momembalina monaasehatina Kawasana Opu?<verse eid="ROM 11:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ROM 11:35" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:35 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 41:11">Ayb. 41:11</ref>. </char>
    </note>Atawa incema mopadhana modhawuakana saangu giu to Kawasana Opu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:35">sampe o giu incia sumai tabeana abalasia Kawasana Opu?"<verse eid="ROM 11:35" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ROM 11:36" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:36 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CO 8:6">1Kor. 8:6</ref>.</char>
    </note>Roonamo bhari-bharia giu aminaaka i Aulataʼala, alaloi Aulataʼala, kasiimpo to Aulataʼala, tee tangkanamo to Aulataʼala o kamuliangi saʼumurua! Aamin.<verse eid="ROM 11:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ROM 12" />
  <para style="s1">Tadhadhi to Aulataʼala</para>
  <para style="sr">
    <ref loc="ROM 12:1-8">12:1-8</ref>
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 12:1" />E manga witinaiku, alaloi rahumatina Aulataʼala idhawuakana to iaku, iaku kuemani mpuu mamudhaakana upasombaaka karomiu to upamembalia kurubani modhadhi, kurubani momangkilo, tee kurubani imaasiakana Aulataʼala. Mboomo sumai tabeana o ibaadati mototuu-totuuna. <verse eid="ROM 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 12:2" />Bholi uose carana manga mia moosena nawusuuna dunia sii, maka ubhaliimea o fikirimiu mamudhaakana amembali abhaau. Tee mboo sumai ingkomiu amembali umatau opea o kapeeluana Aulataʼala: Siitumo opea momalapena, mopasanaana ngangarandana, tee mosangkana.<verse eid="ROM 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 12:3" />Aulataʼala padhamo adhawuakaaku rahumati, tee alaloi giu incia sumai iaku kuudhaniakakomiu: Bholi uabhi karomiu apenting mpuu minaaka i kadhaangiamiu mototuu-totuuna, maka upekatambemea o karomiu mboomo kaogena iimani mopadhana idhawuakana Aulataʼala to ingkomiu samia-samia. <verse eid="ROM 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 12:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:4-5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 12:12">1Kor. 12:12</ref>.</char></note>Roonamo apokana mboomo badana maanusia abhari o parewana, maka inda bhari-bharia parewana badana maanusia sumai apokana o tugasina, <verse eid="ROM 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 12:5" />mboomo uka tee ingkita, moomini tabhari, maka tamembali saangu bada roonamo taposaangu tee Al Masi, tee bhari-bharia parewana badata apokai-kai i nuncana saangu bada. <verse eid="ROM 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 12:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:6-8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 14:4-11">1Kor. 14:4-11</ref>.</char></note>Bhari-bharikita tapotibhaaka rahumati moposala-sala mopokanana mboomo kalapena incana Aulataʼala to ingkita samia-samia. Rampaakanamo sumai ande tapotibhaaka rahumati to tapakawaaka kasameana Aulataʼala, sumaimo ingkita tabeana tapakoleleakea apokana tee kaogena iimanita. <verse eid="ROM 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 12:7" />Ande tapotibhaaka rahumati to tatulungi mia, sumaimo ingkita tabeana tampuu-mpuu tatulungia. Tee ande tapotibhaaka rahumati to taadhari mia, sumaimo ingkita tabeana tampuu-mpuu taadharia. <verse eid="ROM 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 12:8" />Ande tapotibhaaka rahumati to tapekaogeaka incana mia mosagaanana, sumaimo ingkita tabeana tapekaogeakea tee mpuu-mpuuna incata, tee ande tapotibhaaka rahumati to tamembali mia momenturuna mopekadhawu, sumaimo ingkita tabeana tapekadhawuaka tee kakatena incata. Mia mopotibhaakana rahumati to momembalina kapala, sumaimo incia tabeana apewaua tee mpuu-mpuuna incana tee tabeana araji. Mia mopotibhaakana rahumati to mosusuakana kaasina incana tee mia mosagaanana, incia tabeana apewaua tee ngangaranda mokaunde-unde.<verse eid="ROM 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kanaasehati to Tadhadhiaka i nuncana Kaasi</para>
  <para style="sr">
    <ref loc="ROM 12:9-21">12:9-21</ref>
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 12:9" />Sadiamo umaasiaka mia mosagaanana tee kakatena incamiu! Pekaridhomo minaaka i giu madhaki, tee upewaumo giu momalape. <verse eid="ROM 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 12:10" />Pomaamaasiakamo tee mia mosagaanana mboomo umaasiaka witinaimiu, tee uporikanamo udhawuaka kahoromatimiu to mia mosagaanana alabhi minaaka uhoromati karomiu. <verse eid="ROM 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 12:11" />Rajimo ukarajaa tee bholimo umangare! Tee utaroakamea o rohimiu ampuu-mpuuaka to alaiani Kawasana Opu. <verse eid="ROM 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 12:12" />Ukaunde-undemo i nuncana kaharapumiu tee Aulataʼala, sabaramo i nuncana kanarakaa, tee urajimo udoʼa. <verse eid="ROM 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 12:13" />Tulungia manga mia mosaalihi indaaka akakuranga, tee uʼusahamo to udhawuakea tampana butunga to manga incia.<verse eid="ROM 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 12:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:14 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 5:44">Mat. 5:44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:28">Luk. 6:28</ref>.</char>
    </note>Ande dhaangia o mia mosikisaakomiu, uemaniakamea kabarakati i Aulataʼala tee bholi utundaia! <verse eid="ROM 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 12:15" />Kaunde-undemo tee manga mia mokaunde-unde, tee utangimo tee manga mia motangi. <verse eid="ROM 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 12:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 3:7">Aar. 3:7</ref>.</char></note>Sainca tee safikirimo podho-podho ingkomiu, bholi ufikiriaka to upekalanga karomiu minaaka i mia mosagaanana, maka uposabhangkamo tee manga mia momisikini. Tee bholi uabhi karomiu umakidha minaaka i kadhaangiamiu mosatotuuna.<verse eid="ROM 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 12:17" />Ande dhaangia o mia mopewauna giu madhaki tee ingkomiu, bholi ubalasia tee giu madhaki. Maka upengkaanakamo tee upewaumo giu momalape i aroana bhari-bharia mia. <verse eid="ROM 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 12:18" />Tee ande amembali, uʼusahamo mamudhaakana udhadhi upomalape tee bhari-bharia mia. <verse eid="ROM 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 12:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:35">Kap. 32:35</ref>.</char></note>E manga witinai imaasiakaku, bholi sampeampearo ubalasi pewauna mia mosagaanana, maka taroakamo Aulataʼala mobalasia tee mohaakimua. Roonamo giu incia sumai padhamo atoburi, "Iaku mokohakuna to mobalasia," mboomo sumai o firimanina Kawasana Opu. <verse eid="ROM 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 12:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 25:21-22">Aar. 25:21-22</ref>.</char></note>Maka:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 12:20">"Ande o musumiu amaara, upakandemea;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 12:20">ande amatuu bhorokona, upasumpumea.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 12:20">Roonamo tee upewau mboo sumai, ingkomiu padhamo udhika weona waa i bhawona bhaana manga incia."<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:20 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Roonamo tee upewau mboo sumai, ingkomiu padhamo udhika weona waa i bhawona bhaana manga incia: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ma`anana amembali giu imaeaakana manga incia. </char></note><verse eid="ROM 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 12:21" />Jadi bholi atalokomiu giu madhaki, maka o giu madhaki sumai tabeana utaloakea tee giu momalape.<verse eid="ROM 12:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ROM 13" />
  <para style="s1">Tataʼati tee Pamarinta</para>
  <para style="sr">
    <ref loc="ROM 13:1-7">13:1-7</ref>
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 13:1" />Bhari-bharia mia tabeana atungku tee pamarinta modhaangiana i bhawona, roonamo inda dhaangia o pamarinta mopotibhaakana kuasa inda mominaakana i Aulataʼala, tee o pamarinta modhaangiana sii-sii atantuakea Aulataʼala. <verse eid="ROM 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 13:2" />Rampaakanamo sumai, incemapo uka mobhalina pamarinta, satotuuna incia abhali tutura mopadhana itantuakana Aulataʼala, tee manga mia mobhalina giu incia sumai bheapotibhaaka kahukumu. <verse eid="ROM 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 13:3" />Roonamo pamarinta sumai amembali saangu giu imaekaakana manga mia mopewauna kadhaki, maka inda amaekaia manga mia mopewauna kalape. Buaka ingkomiu gaumiu utorambasaka minaaka i kaekamiu tee pamarinta sumai? Pewaumo giu malape, sumaimo ingkomiu bheutarima kapujia minaaka i manga incia moparintakomiu sumai. <verse eid="ROM 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 13:4" />Roonamo pamarinta sumai o bhatuana Aulataʼala moumbaakana kalape to ingkomiu. Maka ande upewau giu madhaki, sumaimo ingkomiu tabeana umaeka tee pamarinta sumai, roonamo manga incia tee kuasana to ahukumu mia. Pamarinta sumai o bhatua ipatotapuakana Aulataʼala to mobalasina tee mopekandawuakana pamuruna to bhari-bharia mia mopewauna kadhaki. <verse eid="ROM 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 13:5" />Siitumo sababuna ingkomiu tabeana utungku tee pamarinta, mencuana rampaakanamo soo umaeka tee pamuruna Aulataʼala, maka roonamo i nuncana ngangarandamiu uka umataua ande o giu incia sumai tabeana upewaua.<verse eid="ROM 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 13:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 22:21">Mat. 22:21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:17">Mrk. 12:17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:25">Luk. 20:25</ref>.</char>
    </note>Giumo incia sumai uka ipomeaakamiu balasitee. Roonamo pamarinta sumai o pagawe iparacaeana Aulataʼala to moʼurusuna manga tugasina pamarinta. <verse eid="ROM 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 13:7" />Jadi upomeamea opea molaengana ipomeamiu to mia molaengana motarimaia: Pomeamo balasitee i mia molaengana motarimaia, pomeamo weti i mia molaengana motarimaia, maekamo tee mia molaengana imaekamiu, tee uhoromatimea o mia molaengana ihoromatimiu.<verse eid="ROM 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kaasina Inca Satotuuna o Kapamondona Hukumuna Taurati</para>
  <para style="sr">
    <ref loc="ROM 13:8-10">13:8-10</ref>
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 13:8" />Bholi ukodhosa tee incemapo uka, maka tabeana ukodhosaaka kaasimiu i nuncana upomaamaasiaka podho-podho ingkomiu. Roonamo incemapo uka momaasiakana maanusia rangana, incia padhamo apamondo Hukumuna Taurati. <verse eid="ROM 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 13:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:13-15">Limb. 20:13-15</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 20:17">20:17</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 19:18">Im. 19:18</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:17-19">Kap. 5:17-19</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:21">5:21</ref>.</char></note>Roonamo i nuncana Hukumuna Taurati atoburi, "Bholi upewau zina, bholi upekamate mia, bholi umanako, bholi usintai mokopewauana," tee ande dhaangia o parinta mosagaanana, bhari-bharia adhaangiamo i nuncana parinta incia sii, "Maasiakea o maanusia rangamiu mboomo umaasiaka karomiu." <verse eid="ROM 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 13:10" />Kaasi inda apewau kadhaki tee maanusia rangana. Jadi kaasi sumai kapamondona Hukumuna Taurati.<verse eid="ROM 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Eona Kawasana Opu Amakasumo</para>
  <para style="sr">
    <ref loc="ROM 13:11-14">13:11-14</ref>
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 13:11" />Giu incia sii tabeana upewaua roonamo umataumea o kadhaangia sii-sii, ande akawamo wakutuumiu to ubhangu minaaka i koleamiu. Roonamo kasalaamati sumai alabhimo apomakasu tee ingkita, aposala tee wakutuuna bhaa-bhaana tapepuu taparacaea tee Isa Al Masi. <verse eid="ROM 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 13:12" />Malo padhaaka alapamo, tee o eo amakasumo. Rampaakanamo sumai maimo tabholiaka bhari-bharia pewau momadhaki mominaakana i kagalapu. Maimo tapasiapuaka karota tee tapake ewangata mominaakana i kainawa sumai. <verse eid="ROM 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 13:13" />Dhadhita tabeana abanara mboomo laengana mia modhadhina i nuncana kainawa. Bholi tadhadhi mboomo mia mokokariaa, atawa tadhadhi mboomo mia mopekalango-lango, bholi tadhadhi mboomo pande pebula atawa mboomo mia moosena nawusuuna, tee bholi tapogera-gera atawa tapogigibulu tee mia mosagaanana. <verse eid="ROM 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 13:14" />Maka taroakamo Isa Al Masi Oputa Momalanga motantuakana opea to ipewaumiu. Tee bholi uose feʼelina maanusia moosena nawusuuna karona.<verse eid="ROM 13:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ROM 14" />
  <para style="s1">Bholi Uhaakimu Witinaimiu</para>
  <para style="sr">
    <ref loc="ROM 14:1-12">14:1-12</ref>
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 14:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="COL 2:16">Kol. 2:16</ref>.</char>
    </note>Tarimaia o mia mokurana iimanina<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:1 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">mia mokurana iimanina: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Maʼanana apatujuakea to manga mia moparacaeana tee Isa Al Masi, maka manga incia dhaangiapo aabhi tutura momangenge abanara, siitumo dhaangiapo ahususuaka saangu giumea to ikandena tee isumpuna atawa alabhiaka saangu eo minaaka i eo mosagaanana. </char></note> tee bholimo tapotagaliaka opea modhaangiana i fikirina. <verse eid="ROM 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 14:2" />Dhaangia o mia moparacaeana ande manga incia amembali akande bhari-bharia giuna ikande, maka dhaangia uka o mia mokurana iimanina; manga incia tangkanamo soo akande tawana kaumea. <verse eid="ROM 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 14:3" />Moomini mboo sumai, mia mokandena bhari-bharia giuna ikande bholi apandaʼente mia mokandena soo tawana kaumea, tee o mia soo mokandena tawana kau bholi ahaakimu mia mokandena bhari-bharia giuna ikande, roonamo manga incia padhamo atarimaia Aulataʼala. <verse eid="ROM 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 14:4" />Incema buaka ingkomiu mbakana ubarani uhaakimu bhatuana mia mosagaanana? Tangkanamo opuna mokohakuna to momambotuakana bhatua sumai asala atawa abanara, tee o bhatua sumai bheasadhaadhaa akakaro pekakate, roonamo Kawasana Opu mopakakaroa.<verse eid="ROM 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 14:5" />Mencuana soo incia sumai, dhaangia uka o mia molabhiakana saangu eo minaaka i eo mosagaanana,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:5 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">mia molabhiakana saangu eo minaaka i eo mosagaanana: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Maʼanana saangu eona ibaadati atawa o eo ihususuaka.</char></note> maka dhaangia uka o mia mosagaanana moabhina bhari-bharia eo soo apokanakanamo. Jadi taroakamo bhari-bharia mia atotuu-totuuaka aparacaea tee kambotuna karona mopokanana mboomo antona ngangarandana. <verse eid="ROM 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 14:6" />Mia molabhiakana saangu eo, apewau giu incia sumai to ahoromatiaka Kawasana Opu; mia mokandena bhari-bharia giuna ikande, apewau giu incia sumai to ahoromatiaka Kawasana Opu roonamo incia aemani sukuru i Aulataʼala; tee o mia inda mokandena dagi, apewau giu incia sumai to ahoromatiaka Kawasana Opu tee uka aemani sukuru i Aulataʼala. <verse eid="ROM 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 14:7" />Inda samia uka minaaka i tanga-tangata sii modhadhina tangkanamo to karona samia, tee inda dhaangia minaaka i tanga-tangata sii momatena tangkanamo to karona samia uka. <verse eid="ROM 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 14:8" />Roonamo ande tadhadhi, ingkita tadhadhi to tamuliangi Isa Al Masi Oputa Momalanga, tee ande tamate, ingkita tamate to tamuliangi Isa Al Masi Oputa Momalanga. Jadi o dhadhi tee mateta sii o pewauana Isa Al Masi Oputa Momalanga. <verse eid="ROM 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 14:9" />Rampaakanamo sumai Al Masi amate tee adhadhi pendua, mamudhaakana Incia amembali Oputa Momalanga, malape to manga mia momate atawa to manga mia modhadhi.<verse eid="ROM 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 14:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:10 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CO 5:10">2Kor. 5:10</ref>.</char>
    </note>Jadi apokia ingkomiu uhaakimu witinaimiu? Atawa apokia ingkomiu upandaʼente witinaimiu? Roonamo bhari-bharikita bhetapoaro tee tatoʼadili i aroana pangadilana Aulataʼala. <verse eid="ROM 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 14:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 45:23">Yes. 45:23</ref>.</char></note>Mboomo mopadhana motoburi i nuncana Kitabi Momangkilo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 14:11">"Mboo siimo firimanina Kawasana Opu, 'To karoku mototuu-totuuna modhadhi Iaku kuposumpa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 14:11">bhari-bharia mia bheasuju i aroaku,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 14:11">tee bhari-bharia mia bheapuji Aulataʼala.' "<verse eid="ROM 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 14:12" />Jadi bhari-bharikita bhetapotanggojawapuaka bhari-bharia ipewauta i aroana Aulataʼala.<verse eid="ROM 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bholi Udhika Bhatu Bheitosunuaka</para>
  <para style="sr">
    <ref loc="ROM 14:13-23">14:13-23</ref>
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 14:13" />Rampaakanamo sumai tauntomo tapohaahaakimu podho-podho ingkita. Tee salabhina taʼusaha indaaka tadhika bhatu itosunuaka<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:13 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">bhatu itosunuaka: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Maʼanana o giu ikuraakana iimanina mia atawa o giu imandawuakana mia i nuncana dosa.</char></note> atawa tadhika bhatu ikotibuakana witinaita. <verse eid="ROM 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 14:14" />Roonamo iaku kuposaangu tee Isa Al Masi Oputa Momalanga, iaku kumataua tee kuyaakini ande inda dhaangia saangu giu uka monaajisina. Maka saangu giu amembali anaajisi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:14 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">anaajisi: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Maʼanana o kinande iharamuaka tee motolarangina ikande i nuncana Hukumuna Taurati. </char></note> ande ingkita taabhia anaajisi. <verse eid="ROM 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 14:15" />Ande dhaangia o witinaimiu moparacaeana tee saangu giuna ikande iharamuakana manga incia, kasiimpo ingkomiu uporadhaamiia to ukande kinande incia sumai i aroana manga incia, sumaimo ingkomiu soo apokanamo tee udhaki-dhaki kaparacaeana manga incia tee inda uose kaadharina kaasi. Udhania ande o Isa Al Masi padhamo amateaka witinaimiu sumai. Jadi bholi upahancuru kayaakinina witinaimiu saʼagama rampaakanamo kinande incia sumai. <verse eid="ROM 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 14:16" />Ancosala opea iabhimiu momalapena to karomiu amembali saangu giu moumbaakana fitanaa. <verse eid="ROM 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 14:17" />Roonamo Pamarintana Aulataʼala inda aʼurusu kinande tee giu isumpu, maka aʼurusu kabanara, giu moumbaakana dhadhi malape, tee kaunde-unde i nuncana Rohina Aulataʼala. <verse eid="ROM 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 14:18" />Mia molaianina Isa Al Masi tee cara mboo sumai (siitumo mia mofadulina tee mia mokurana iimanina) apasanaa ngangarandana Aulataʼala, tee bheaharagaangia maanusia rangana.<verse eid="ROM 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 14:19" />Rampaakanamo sumai, maimo taoseaka manga giu moumbaakana dhadhi malape tee tapopekatangkaaka iimanita podho-podho ingkita. <verse eid="ROM 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 14:20" />Bholi udhaki-dhaki opea mopadhana ikarajaana Aulataʼala rampaakanamo kinande! Bhari-bharia kinande inciamo amangkilo, maka o mia bheatoabhi apewau kasalaha ande roonamo opea ikandena sumai amembali bhatu itosunuakana mia mosagaanana. <verse eid="ROM 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 14:21" />Salabhina bholi ukande dagi atawa usumpu angguru, atawa upewau opeapo uka itosunuakana witinaimiu.<verse eid="ROM 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 14:22" />Taroakamo kaparacaeamiu mopokaina tee soʼalina giu kinande, giu isumpu tee eo mohususu tangkanamo karomiu mokeniakea tee tangkanamo ingkomiu tee Aulataʼala momataua. Amasanaamo mia inda mopasalana karona roonamo apewau giu iabhina abanara. <verse eid="ROM 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 14:23" />Maka ande ingkomiu ukande saangu giuna ikande, tee o giuna ikande incia sumai umeriakea inda ahalala, sumaimo ingkomiu bheutohaakimu, kaapaaka ingkomiu inda uose opea iyaakinimiu. Roonamo ande tapewau giu moposalana tee kayaakinita i aroana Aulataʼala, maʼanana ingkita padhamo tapewau dosa.<verse eid="ROM 14:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ROM 15" />
  <para style="s1">Upotulutulungimo tee Witinaimiu Saʼiimani</para>
  <para style="sr">
    <ref loc="ROM 15:1-13">15:1-13</ref>
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 15:1" />Ingkita momakaana tabeana tatanggo kakurangana mia momalute, tee bholi tapeelo kasanaata karota. <verse eid="ROM 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 15:2" />Maka bhari-bharikita tabeana tapasanaa ngangarandana manga witinaita to kalapena manga incia, mamudhaakana opea iyaakinina ahanda amatangka. <verse eid="ROM 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 15:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 69:10">Zab. 69:10</ref>.</char></note>Roonamo Al Masi uka inda apeelo kasanaana karona, maka mboomo mopadhana motoburi i nuncana Kitabi Momangkilo, "Bhari-bharia kahinana manga mia mohinako akangkanaimo karoku." <verse eid="ROM 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 15:4" />Bhari-bharia giu motoburina i zamani mangenge atoburi i nuncana Kitabi Momangkilo to amembaliaka kaadhari to ingkita mamudhaakana tapotibhaaka kaharapu minaaka i kasabara tee kahiburu modhaangiana i nuncana Kitabi Momangkilo sumai.<verse eid="ROM 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 15:5" />Maasangia o Aulataʼala adhawuakakomiu kasabara tee kahiburu, tee abarakatikomiu mamudhaakana udhadhi sainca safikiri uose kapeeluana Isa Al Masi, <verse eid="ROM 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 15:6" />sabutuna ingkomiu usainca safikiri tee upobhawa-bhawa umuliangi Aulataʼala, Amana Oputa Momalanga, Isa Al Masi.<verse eid="ROM 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 15:7" />Jadi rampaakanamo Al Masi padhamo atarimakomiu umembali uumatina, sumaimo ingkomiu tabeana upotaritarimamo uka podho-podho ingkomiu, mamudhaakana o Aulataʼala atomuliangi. <verse eid="ROM 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 15:8" />Iaku kupogau mboo sumai roonamo Al Masi amembalimo bhatuana mia mototandaki to asusuaka kabanarana Aulataʼala tee apekatangkaaka opea mopadhana ijanjiakana to manga incia. Tee mboo sumai, Al Masi padhamo abukutiiakea ande bhari-bharia pojanjiana Aulataʼala to manga opu-opuana miana Yahudi sumai abanara, <verse eid="ROM 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 15:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 22:50">2Sam. 22:50</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 18:50">Zab. 18:50</ref>.</char></note>tee mamudhaakana manga mia inda motolentuna miana Yahudi uka amembali amuliangi Aulataʼala rampaakanamo kaasina incana to manga incia, mboomo mopadhana motoburi i nuncana Kitabi Mangkilo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:9">"Rampaakanamo sumai, iaku bhekumuliangiko i tanga-tangana manga lipu inda motolentuna miana Yahudi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:9">tee kulaguaka lagu kapujia to saromu."<verse eid="ROM 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 15:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:10 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 32:43">Kap. 32:43</ref>.</char>
    </note>Dhaangia uka i aeati mosagaanana motoburina mboo sii:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:10">"E manga mia inda motolentuna miana Yahudi, kaunde-undemo tee uumati mopadhana ipilina Aulataʼala."<verse eid="ROM 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 15:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:11 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 117:1">Zab. 117:1</ref>.</char>
    </note>Tee dhaangia uka o firimanina Aulataʼala mopogauna mboo sii:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:11">"E bhari-bharia manga mia inda motolentuna miana Yahudi, pujimo Kawasana Opu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:11">taroakamo bhari-bharia lipu apujiaka Incia."<verse eid="ROM 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 15:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:12 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 11:10">Yes. 11:10</ref>.</char>
    </note>Nabii Yesaya uka apogau,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:12">"Bheadhaangia o siwulu moumbana minaaka i Isai,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:12 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">siwulu moumbana minaaka i Isai: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Maʼanana apatujuakea to Isa Al Masi mominaakana i siwuluna Raja Daud anana Isai. </char></note></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:12">Incia bheaumba to aparinta bhari-bharia lipu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:12">Tee manga mia inda motolentuna miana Yahudi bheaharapu tee Incia."<verse eid="ROM 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 15:13" />Maasangia o Aulataʼala momembalina iharaputa sumai, adhawuakakomiu sagala giuna kasanaa tee dhadhi momalape i nuncana iimanimiu, mamudhaakana tee kuasana Rohina Aulataʼala Momangkilo ingkomiu ahanda uparacaea ande o Aulataʼala atotuu-totuu apewaua o janjina.<verse eid="ROM 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Paul Apetulatulaaka Opea Mopadhana Ipewauna tee Manga Mia Inda Motolentuna Miana Yahudi</para>
  <para style="sr">
    <ref loc="ROM 15:14-21">15:14-21</ref>
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 15:14" />E manga witinaiku, iaku kuyaakini mpuu ande abhari o giu momalape modhaangiana i karomiu. Ingkomiu uka abhari o giu imataumiu sabutuna amembali uponaasenaasehati podho-podho ingkomiu. <verse eid="ROM 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 15:15" />Maka moomini mboo sumai, iaku tee kabaraniku padhamo kuburiakakomiu pia angu giu <char style="add">i nuncana sura incia sii </char> to kuudhaniakakomiu pendua rampaakanamo rahumati mopadhana idhawuakana Aulataʼala to karoku, <verse eid="ROM 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 15:16" />siitumo iaku kumembali bhatuana Isa Al Masi to manga mia inda motolentuna miana Yahudi. Tee iaku kukarajaa opea momembalina tugasina imamu to kupakoleleaka Lele Malape minaaka i Aulataʼala, mamudhaakana manga mia inda motolentuna miana Yahudi atarimaia Aulataʼala amembali saangu pasombaa imaasiakana Aulataʼala tee ipekangkilona Rohina Aulataʼala.<verse eid="ROM 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 15:17" />Jadi rampaakanamo sumai, iaku kumembali kubangga roonamo kuposaangu tee Isa Al Masi pokaiana tee bhari-bharia giu mopadhana ipewauku to Aulataʼala. <verse eid="ROM 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 15:18" />Iaku inda kubarani kupogauaka manga giu mosagaanana, iaku tangkanamo soo kupogauaka opea mopadhana ipewauna Isa Al Masi alaloi karoku, sabutuna alaloi bhoasakaku tee pemingkuiku, iaku kumembali kutonda manga mia inda motolentuna miana Yahudi mamudhaakana ataʼati tee Aulataʼala. <verse eid="ROM 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 15:19" />Tee manga incia amembali ataʼati Aulataʼala roonamo kupayaakiniakea tee manga muuzizati tee manga giu inda momentela, tee uka kuasana Rohina Aulataʼala. Tee mboo sumai, iaku padhamo kupakoleleaka Lele Malape pokaiana tee Isa Al Masi i bhari-bharia tampa mopadhana ileongiku, pepuu minaaka i Kota Yerusalem sakawana i Poropinsi Ilirikum.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:19 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Poropinsi Ilirikum: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sii-sii o poropinsi incia sii amembalimo lipuna Albania tee i lipu i saripina, siitumo i timbuna Italia. </char></note> <verse eid="ROM 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 15:20" />Iaku satotuuna gauku mpuu bhekupakoleleaka Lele Malape i tampana manga mia indapo morangona sarona Al Masi, roonamo iaku kumendeu kupabhangu saangu bhanua i bhawona fondasi mopadhana ikarajaana mia mosagaanana. <verse eid="ROM 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 15:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 52:15">Yes. 52:15</ref>.</char></note>Apokana tee motoburina i nuncana Kitabi Momangkilo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:21">"Manga mia indapo motarimana lelena bheakamatea,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:21">tee manga mia indapo morangoa bheamaʼanaia."<verse eid="ROM 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Paul Ahaejati to Alingka i Kota Roma</para>
  <para style="sr">
    <ref loc="ROM 15:22-33">15:22-33</ref>
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 15:22" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:22 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 1:13">Rom. 1:13</ref>.</char>
    </note>Rampaakanamo sumai, iaku sadia inda tee kalalesaku to kuleongikomiu i Kota Roma. <verse eid="ROM 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 15:23" />Maka sii-sii, aselesaimo tugasiku i manga lipu incia sii, tee dhaangiamo pia tao kangengena iaku gauku kuleongikomiu, <verse eid="ROM 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 15:24" />sumaimo iaku kuharapu amembali kubutu i tampamiu tee tapokawa wakutuuna kulingka i Poropinsi Spanyol.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:24 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Poropinsi Spanyol: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Saangu poropinsi mopesuana i pamarintana Roma modhaangiana mpuu i weta i bhara. </char></note> Iaku uka kuharapu mamudhaakana ingkomiu uunda utulungiaku wakutuuna kupalausaka lingkaaku i Spanyol sapadhana kupobhawa-bhawa kuniʼimati wakutuuku sabantara tee ingkomiu. <verse eid="ROM 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 15:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:25-26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 16:1-4">1Kor. 16:1-4</ref>.</char></note>Maka sii-sii, iaku tangasaana i nuncana lingkaaku i Yerusalem to kubhawa kahamba to manga mia mosaalihi iwe sumai. <verse eid="ROM 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 15:26" />Roonamo manga miana Makedonia tee Akhaya<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:26 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Makedonia tee Akhaya: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Poropinsi-poropinsi modhaangiana i pamarintana Roma mopesuana i lipuna Makedonia tee Yunani sii-sii.</char></note> padhamo apomambotu to adhawuaka kahambana to manga mia mosaalihi momisikinina modhaangiana i Yerusalem. <verse eid="ROM 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 15:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 9:11">1Kor. 9:11</ref>.</char></note>Miana Makedonia tee Akhaya akaunde-unde mpuu amambotuaka giu incia sumai, tee o giu incia sumai aabhia saangu giu iwaajibuakana to manga incia. Roonamo minaaka i miana Yahudi sumai manga mia inda motolentuna miana Yahudi padhamo apotibhaaka dhawu i nuncana kabarakatina rohina Aulataʼala. Jadi manga mia inda motolentuna miana Yahudi sumai awaajibu uka to alaiani manga miana Yahudi tee harataana manga incia. <verse eid="ROM 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 15:28" />Jadi sapadhana kupaselesai tugasiku tee sapadhana kupasaraakaaka kahamba mopadhana imateraiku sii, iaku bhekubhose i lipuna Spanyol tee kusii i tampamiu. <verse eid="ROM 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 15:29" />Iaku kuyaakini, ande kuumba i tampamiu, iaku bhekuumba tee kabarakatina Al Masi motaralabhi-labhi.<verse eid="ROM 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 15:30" />E manga witinaiku, tee sarona Isa Al Masi, Oputa Momalanga, tee kaasi mominaakana i Rohina Aulataʼala, iaku kunaasehatiakakomiu mpuu to upobhawa-bhawaaka udoʼaakaaku tee kampuu-mpuuna incamiu <verse eid="ROM 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 15:31" />mamudhaakana o Aulataʼala apasalaamatiaku minaaka i manga mia inda moparacaeaia modhaangiana i lipuna Yudea, tee mamudhaakana o kahamba ibhawaku i Yerusalem sii atarimaia pekalape manga mia mosaalihi modhaangiana iwe sumako. <verse eid="ROM 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 15:32" />Tee uka, ande o Aulataʼala adhawuaku kalalesa, iaku bhekuumbatikomiu i Kota Roma tee ngangaranda mokaunde-unde, tee o namisiku bheatohiburu mpuu i tanga-tangamiu. <verse eid="ROM 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 15:33" />Maasangia o Aulataʼala minaana dhadhi malape to maanusia sumai apoose tee ingkomiu bhari-bharikomiu. Aamin.<verse eid="ROM 15:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ROM 16" />
  <para style="s1">Salamuna Paul to Manga Mia Moparacaeana i Kota Roma</para>
  <para style="sr">
    <ref loc="ROM 16:1-16">16:1-16</ref>
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 16:1" />Iaku gauku kupapomataukomiu tee samia witinaita bhawine mokosaroakana Febe. Incia o witinaita molaianina jamaʼa i Kota Kengkrea. <verse eid="ROM 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 16:2" />Ingkomiu tabeana utarimaia roonamo uposaangu tee Kawasana Opu mboomo laengana ipewauna manga mia mosaalihi, tee ingkomiu tabeana utulungia ande afaraluu kahambamiu, roonamo incia padhamo atulungi mia bhari tee incia uka padhamo atulungiaku.<verse eid="ROM 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 16:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:3 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 18:2">Tul. 18:2</ref>.</char>
    </note>Pakawaakea o salamuku to Priskila tee Akila, siitumo manga sabhangkaku sakarajaa to Isa Al Masi. <verse eid="ROM 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 16:4" />Manga incia padhamo ataa inyawana to apasalaamatiaku. Mencuana soo iaku mopotarimakaasina tee manga incia, maka bhari-bharia jamaʼa mominaakana i manga mia inda motolentuna miana Yahudi uka.<verse eid="ROM 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 16:5" />Pakawaakea uka o salamuku to jamaʼa moporomusakana i bhanuana manga incia.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 16:5">Salamuku to Epenetus witinai imaasiakaku; incia o mia mobhaa-bhaana moparacaeana tee Al Masi i Poropinsi Asia.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:5 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Poropinsi Asia: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Saangu poropinsina pamarintana Roma tee ibu kotana i wakutuu incia sumai o Kota Efesus, momembalina tampa mbooresana Paul wakutuuna alaiani Kawasana Opu. Sii-sii o "Poropinsi Asia" sii adhaangia i weta i bhara i lipuna "Turki."</char></note><verse eid="ROM 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 16:6" />Salamuku uka to Maria, mopadhana momanguleakana karona to ingkomiu.<verse eid="ROM 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 16:7" />Salamu to Andronikus tee Yunias; manga witinai salipuku tee manga sabhangkaku i nuncana katorongku. Manga mia incia sii satotuuna manga mia molabhina motohoromatina i tanga-tangana manga rasulu mosagaanana tee aporikana manga incia moparacaeana tee Al Masi kasiimpo iaku.<verse eid="ROM 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 16:8" />Salamu to Ampliatus o sabhangkaku roonamo ingkami taposaangu tee Kawasana Opu.<verse eid="ROM 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 16:9" />Salamu to Urbanus, sabhangka sakarajaamami to Isa Al Masi, tee o salamu uka to Stakhis imaasiakaku.<verse eid="ROM 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 16:10" />Salamu to Apeles, mia mopadhana molaloina kapancoba tee akobukutii ande incia atotuu-totuu amaasiaka Al Masi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 16:10">Salamu tee bhari-bharia miana bhanuana Aristobulus.<verse eid="ROM 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 16:11" />Salamu to Herodion witinai salipuku.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 16:11">Salamu tee bhari-bharia miana bhanuana Narkisus moparacaeana tee Kawasana Opu.<verse eid="ROM 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 16:12" />Pakawaakea o salamuku to Trifena tee Trifosa, mokarajaana mosawunabukuna molaianina Kawasana Opu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 16:12">Salamu to Persis sabhangka imaasiakaku. Incia uka mokarajaana mosawunabukuna molaianina Kawasana Opu.<verse eid="ROM 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 16:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:13 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MRK 15:21">Mrk. 15:21</ref>.</char>
    </note>Salamu to Rufus o mia mokokalabhia ipilina Kawasana Opu, tee o salamuku uka tee inana iabhiku mboomo inaku karoku.<verse eid="ROM 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 16:14" />Salamu to Asinkritus, Flegon, Hermes, Patrobas, Hermas, tee uka manga witinai mosaʼagama mopoosena tee manga incia.<verse eid="ROM 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 16:15" />Salamu to Filologus tee Yulia, Nereus tee witinaina bhawine, kasiimpo Olimpas, tee bhari-bharia mia mosaalihi mopoosena tee manga incia.<verse eid="ROM 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 16:16" />Uposalasalamumo podho-podho ingkomiu tee salamu momangkilo mobukeakana kaasi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 16:16">Bhari-bharia jamaʼana Al Masi apakawaaka salamuna to ingkomiu.<verse eid="ROM 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kaudhaniaka Kapadhaa</para>
  <para style="sr">
    <ref loc="ROM 16:17-24">16:17-24</ref>
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 16:17" />E manga witinaiku, iaku kuemani mpuu mamudhaakana ukoengati tee manga mia moumbaakana giu mopapogaagaakomiu tee ukoengati tee mia mopasaladhalakomiu minaaka i kaadhari mopadhana ipengkaadhariakamiu. Rampaakanamo sumai upekaridhomea o karomiu minaaka i manga incia, <verse eid="ROM 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 16:18" />roonamo manga mia incia sumai inda alaiani Isa Al Masi Oputa Momalanga, maka soo alaiani nawusuuna karona. Manga incia atipu manga mia momakatena incana tee bhoasaka mopekawuju tee momamekona rangoana.<verse eid="ROM 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 16:19" />Kataʼatimiu arangomea bhari-bharia mia. Rampaakanamo sumai iaku kukaunde-undeakakomiumo. Iaku gauku ingkomiu uʼaarifuaka bhari-bharia giu momalape, tee umangkilo minaaka i bhari-bharia giu momadhaki.<verse eid="ROM 16:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 16:20" />Aulataʼala o minaana dhadhi malape sumai bhealausaka apatungku ibilisi i tambena aemiu tee apahancurua.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 16:20">Maasangia o Isa Oputa Momalanga abarakatikomiu.<verse eid="ROM 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 16:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:21 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 16:1">Tul. 16:1</ref>.</char>
    </note>Salamuna Timotius sabhangkaku sakarajaa to ingkomiu, tee uka o salamu minaaka i Lukius, Yason, tee Sosipater sabhangkaku mosalipuna tee iaku to ingkomiu.<verse eid="ROM 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 16:22" />Iaku o Tertius mohambana moburina sura incia sii uka kupakawaaka salamuku to ingkomiu sampokanata moparacaeana tee Kawasana Opu.<verse eid="ROM 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 16:23" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:23 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 19:29">Tul. 19:29</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 1:14">1Kor. 1:14</ref>; <ref loc="2TI 4:20">2Tim. 4:20</ref>.</char>
    </note>Gayus modhawuakana tampana butunga to iaku (Paul) tee bhari-bharia jamaʼa alamboko salamuna uka to ingkomiu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 16:23">Erastus, bendaharana kota,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:23 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">bendaharana kota: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Maʼanana o mia motoparacaeaakana to mokenina doina Kota Korintus. </char></note> tee Kwartus witinaita uka alamboko salamuna to ingkomiu.<verse eid="ROM 16:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 16:24" />[Maasangia o Isa Al Masi Oputa Momalanga abarakatikomiu. Aamin.]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:24 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Maasangia o Isa Al Masi Oputa Momalanga abarakatikomiu. Aamin: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Dhaangia uka o kaburi mosagaanana inda tee aeati incia sii.</char></note><verse eid="ROM 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bhari-bharia Kamuliangi to Aulataʼala</para>
  <para style="sr">
    <ref loc="ROM 16:25-27">16:25-27</ref>
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 16:25" />Atopujimo Aulataʼala! Incia akokuasa apekatangkaaka iimanimiu alaloi Lele Malape mominaakana i Aulataʼala mopadhana ipakoleleakaku pokaiana tee Isa Al Masi. Iaku kupakoleleaka lele incia sumai apokana mboomo mopadhana ipakawaakana Aulataʼala; siitumo pokaiana tee haejatina Aulataʼala pepuu minaaka i zamani momangenge mpuu. <verse eid="ROM 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 16:26" />Maka sii-sii o rahasia incia sumai padhamo apakawaakea tee apakoleleakea to bhari-bharia lipu apokana tee parintana Aulataʼala mobakaa tee alaloi Kitabi Mangkilo minaaka i manga nabii, mamudhaakana manga incia aparacaea tee ataʼati tee Aulataʼala. <verse eid="ROM 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 16:27" />Incia sakaro-karona o Aulataʼala, Incia o Kawasana Opu mobukeakana hikimati. Maasangia Incia atomuliangi saʼumurua alaloi Isa Al Masi! Aamin.<verse eid="ROM 16:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 16" />
</usx>